<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport"/>
<title>海外游戏行业热点 2026年10月</title>
<style>
/* === RESET & BASE === */
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI','PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;background:var(--bg-primary);color:var(--text-primary);line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
.container{max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 120px}

/* === DESIGN TOKENS === */
:root{
--bg-primary:#F7F5F2;--bg-secondary:#FAF8F4;--bg-tertiary:#F0EDEA;
--surface:#FFFFFF;--surface-hover:#FAFAF8;--surface-muted:#F5F3EF;
--text-primary:#1F1C24;--text-secondary:#5E5866;--text-tertiary:#9892A0;--text-quaternary:#B8B3BF;
--text-inverse:#FFFFFF;--border:#E5E1DA;--border-strong:#D5D0C8;--border-subtle:#F0EDE8;
--accent-blue:#5A7A91;--accent-sage:#7A9E7D;--accent-warm:#B0855A;--accent-rose:#A8726D;
--accent-lavender:#8A7FA0;--accent-amber:#B89C5A;--accent-blue-deep:#3D5A6E;--accent-warm-deep:#8C6540;
--shadow-sm:0 1px 3px rgba(31,28,36,0.04),0 1px 2px rgba(31,28,36,0.02);
--shadow-md:0 4px 12px rgba(31,28,36,0.06),0 2px 4px rgba(31,28,36,0.03);
--shadow-lg:0 8px 24px rgba(31,28,36,0.08),0 4px 8px rgba(31,28,36,0.04);
--shadow-hover:0 12px 32px rgba(31,28,36,0.10),0 6px 12px rgba(31,28,36,0.05);
--drawer-shadow:-4px 0 24px rgba(31,28,36,0.10),-1px 0 8px rgba(31,28,36,0.04);
}

/* === TAB BAR === */
.tab-bar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(247,245,242,0.92);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:12px 0;display:flex;gap:8px;overflow-x:auto}
.tab-btn{padding:8px 16px;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--surface);color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;transition:all 0.2s}
.tab-btn:hover{background:var(--surface-hover)}
.tab-btn.active{background:var(--text-primary);color:var(--text-inverse);border-color:var(--text-primary)}

/* === PANELS === */
.panel{display:none;padding:24px 0 80px}
.panel.active{display:block}

/* === EXECUTIVE SNAPSHOT === */
.header-area{padding:32px 0 24px}
.header-area h1{font-size:32px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.5px;margin-bottom:8px}
.subtitle{color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:15px;margin-bottom:24px}
.counter-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:32px}
.counter-card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:20px 16px;text-align:center;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}
.counter-card .number{font-size:36px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text-primary);line-height:1}
.counter-card .label{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-tertiary);margin-top:4px}

/* EXECUTIVE SNAPSHOT CARD */
.exec-snapshot{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3D5A6E 0%,#5A7A91 100%);border-radius:16px;padding:28px 24px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:32px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg)}
.exec-badge{display:inline-block;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);color:#fff;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:20px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-bottom:12px}
.exec-title{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;letter-spacing:-0.3px}
.exec-body{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9)}

/* SUMMARY NAVIGATION */
.summary-nav{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:32px}
.nav-item{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}
.nav-item:hover{box-shadow:var(--shadow-hover);transform:translateY(-2px);border-color:var(--accent-blue)}
.nav-icon{font-size:24px;margin-bottom:8px}
.nav-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-primary);margin-bottom:4px}
.nav-count{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent-blue);background:var(--bg-tertiary);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;margin-left:6px}
.nav-desc{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.5}

/* === SECTION HEADINGS === */
.section-h{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;margin:32px 0 16px;padding-bottom:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.meta-tag{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-tertiary);background:var(--surface-muted);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:8px}
.section-h .meta-tag{margin-bottom:0;font-size:10px}

/* === SIGNAL GRID & CARDS === */
.signal-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:24px}
.signal-card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}
.signal-card:hover{box-shadow:var(--shadow-hover);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.signal-card.dominant{grid-column:span 2}
.badge{display:inline-block;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px}
.badge.dominant{background:var(--accent-warm);color:var(--text-inverse)}
.badge.recurring{background:var(--accent-blue);color:var(--text-inverse)}
.badge.emerging{background:var(--accent-sage);color:var(--text-inverse)}
.signal-card h3{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px}
.signal-card p{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.5}

/* === EVENTS GRID & CARDS === */
.events-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:24px}
.event-card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);border-left:3px solid var(--accent-lavender)}
.event-card:hover{box-shadow:var(--shadow-hover);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.event-date{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent-lavender);margin-bottom:8px;letter-spacing:0.5px}
.event-date span{margin-left:6px;color:var(--text-tertiary);font-weight:400}
.event-card h4{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--text-primary)}
.event-card p{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.5}

/* === IMPLICATION GRID & CARDS === */
.impl-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:24px}
.impl-card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:16px}
.impl-card .icon{font-size:24px;margin-bottom:8px}
.impl-card h4{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px}
.impl-card p{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.5}

/* === STATS ROW === */
.stats-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:24px}
.stat-card{background:var(--surface-muted);border-radius:8px;padding:16px;text-align:center}
.stat-card .num{font-size:28px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-warm)}
.stat-card .lbl{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-tertiary);margin-top:2px}

/* === TAG CLOUD === */
.tag-cloud{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:24px}
.tag{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:6px 14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary)}
.tag:hover{background:var(--surface-hover);cursor:default}

/* === WEEKLY FILTER BAR === */
.filter-bottom{position:sticky;bottom:0;z-index:90;background:rgba(247,245,242,0.95);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:12px 0;display:flex;gap:6px;overflow-x:auto}
.fchip{padding:6px 12px;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--surface);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary);cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;transition:all 0.2s}
.fchip:hover,.fchip.active{background:var(--text-primary);color:var(--text-inverse);border-color:var(--text-primary)}

/* === DAY SECTION === */
.day-section{margin-bottom:20px}
.day-header{font-size:18px;font-weight:600;padding:12px 0 8px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--border-strong);margin-bottom:12px}

/* === ARTICLE CARDS === */
.article-card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:10px;transition:all 0.2s;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}
.article-card:hover{box-shadow:var(--shadow-md)}
.article-card.feature{border-left:3px solid var(--accent-lavender)}
.cat-tag{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-bottom:6px}
.article-card h4{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--text-primary)}
.article-card .body{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:6px}
.article-card .meta{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-quaternary)}
.source-link{display:inline-block;margin-top:8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent-blue);text-decoration:none}
.source-link:hover{text-decoration:underline}

/* === DRAWER === */
.drawer-overlay{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:rgba(31,28,36,0.4);z-index:200;display:none}
.drawer-overlay.active{display:block}
.drawer-panel{position:fixed;top:0;right:0;width:520px;max-width:90vw;height:100%;background:var(--surface);z-index:201;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform 0.3s;box-shadow:var(--drawer-shadow);overflow-y:auto}
.drawer-panel.active{transform:translateX(0)}
.drawer-header{padding:20px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.drawer-header h3{font-size:18px;font-weight:600}
.drawer-close{font-size:24px;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;color:var(--text-tertiary)}
.drawer-section{padding:16px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-subtle)}
.ds-label{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-tertiary);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-bottom:6px}
.ds-content{font-size:14px;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.6}
.related-signal{transition:background 0.2s}
.related-signal:hover{background:var(--surface-hover)}


/* v7 editorial additions */
.audit-notice{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9d4c9;border-left:4px solid #B0855A;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;margin:0 0 28px;font-size:13px;color:#5E5866;line-height:1.75}
.audit-title{font-weight:700;color:#1F1C24;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:8px}.audit-status{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;color:#8C6540;background:#f6eee4;border-radius:12px;padding:2px 9px;margin-left:8px}.audit-notice p+p{margin-top:8px}.audit-foot{font-size:11px;color:#89838d}.exec-body p+p{margin-top:12px}.snapshot-note{font-size:12px;opacity:.83;border-top:1px solid #ffffff50;padding-top:10px}.focus-intro{font-size:13px;color:#5E5866;margin-bottom:14px}.focus-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E5E1DA;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;margin-bottom:12px}.focus-card h3{font-size:16px;margin-bottom:8px}.focus-card p{font-size:13px;color:#5E5866;margin:6px 0;line-height:1.65}.focus-links{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;margin-top:10px}.focus-links a{color:#3D5A6E;font-size:12px;text-decoration:none}.focus-links a:hover{text-decoration:underline}.verify-tag{display:inline-block;color:#8C6540;background:#f6eee4;border-radius:4px;margin-left:8px;padding:2px 6px;font-size:10px}@media(max-width:600px){.audit-notice{padding:14px}.counter-card .label{font-size:10px}}
</style>
<style>
.impl-card-expanded {border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--surface);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;}
.impl-card-expanded p {font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.7;margin:7px 0;}
.impl-card-expanded p strong {color:var(--text-primary);}
.focus-source-link {display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--accent-blue);text-decoration:none;line-height:1.55;margin-top:9px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}
.focus-source-link:hover{text-decoration:underline;}
.research-link{background:#e8f0f4;color:#315b78;border:1px solid #b8cbd6;padding:10px 15px;border-radius:9px;font-weight:650;cursor:pointer;margin-top:10px}.research-link:hover{background:#dceaf1}.research-metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(140px,1fr));gap:12px;margin:18px 0}.research-metrics>div{background:#f2f5f5;padding:16px;border-radius:12px}.research-metrics b{display:block;font-size:25px;color:#315b78}.research-metrics span{font-size:12px;color:#607280}.research-source{font-size:12px!important;color:#75828a!important}.impl-card-expanded h4{margin-top:22px}#newzoo .section-h{scroll-margin-top:20px}
</style><style>#tgs .tgs-original *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
#tgs .tgs-original{background:var(--bg);color:var(--txt);font-family:"Segoe UI","PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;padding-bottom:60px}
#tgs .tgs-original .wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px}
#tgs .tgs-original header{padding:56px 0 30px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:36px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#101827 0%,#0d1117 60%)}
#tgs .tgs-original header h1{font-size:34px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:10px}
#tgs .tgs-original header h1 span{color:var(--acc2)}
#tgs .tgs-original header .sub{color:var(--sub);font-size:15px}
#tgs .tgs-original .meta{display:flex;gap:28px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px;color:var(--sub);font-size:13px}
#tgs .tgs-original .meta b{color:var(--txt)}
#tgs .tgs-original h2{font-size:24px;font-weight:700;margin:52px 0 6px;color:var(--acc)}
#tgs .tgs-original h2 .no{display:inline-block;background:var(--acc);color:#0d1117;font-size:13px;border-radius:6px;padding:2px 10px;margin-right:12px;vertical-align:3px;font-weight:700}
#tgs .tgs-original h3{font-size:17px;margin:24px 0 8px;color:var(--txt)}
#tgs .tgs-original p.lead{color:var(--sub);font-size:14px;margin-bottom:20px}
#tgs .tgs-original .grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px}
#tgs .tgs-original .grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
#tgs .tgs-original .card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:22px 24px}
#tgs .tgs-original .card h4{font-size:15px;margin-bottom:12px;color:var(--txt)}
#tgs .tgs-original .kpi{display:flex;gap:16px}
#tgs .tgs-original .kpi .box{flex:1;min-width:150px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:20px 8px;text-align:center}
#tgs .tgs-original .kpi .num{font-size:32px;font-weight:800;color:var(--acc);line-height:1.2}
#tgs .tgs-original .kpi .num.o{color:var(--acc2)}
#tgs .tgs-original .kpi .num.p{color:var(--acc4)}
#tgs .tgs-original .kpi .num.g{color:var(--acc3)}
#tgs .tgs-original .kpi .num.r{color:#f85149}
#tgs .tgs-original .kpi .lbl{color:var(--sub);font-size:12px;margin-top:6px}
#tgs .tgs-original .trend{border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid var(--acc);border-radius:12px;background:var(--card);padding:20px 22px;margin:18px 0}
#tgs .tgs-original .trend.warn{border-left-color:var(--acc2)}
#tgs .tgs-original .trend.good{border-left-color:var(--acc3)}
#tgs .tgs-original .trend .t-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px}
#tgs .tgs-original .trend .t-no{background:var(--acc);color:#0d1117;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px;padding:2px 8px;flex-shrink:0}
#tgs .tgs-original .trend.warn .t-no{background:var(--acc2)}
#tgs .tgs-original .trend.good .t-no{background:var(--acc3)}
#tgs .tgs-original .trend .t-title{font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--txt)}
#tgs .tgs-original .trend .t-judge{font-size:14px;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--txt)}
#tgs .tgs-original .trend .t-judge b{color:var(--acc2)}
#tgs .tgs-original .trend .t-ev{font-size:14px;color:var(--txt)}
#tgs .tgs-original .trend .t-ev b{color:var(--acc3)}
#tgs .tgs-original .trend .t-ev ul{margin-left:20px}
#tgs .tgs-original .callout{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#101827,#161b22);border:1px solid var(--acc2);border-radius:14px;padding:22px 24px;font-size:14px;margin:18px 0}
#tgs .tgs-original .callout b{color:var(--acc2)}
#tgs .tgs-original .note{color:var(--sub);font-size:12px;margin-top:8px}
#tgs .tgs-original table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}
#tgs .tgs-original th, #tgs .tgs-original td{padding:10px 14px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
#tgs .tgs-original th{background:#1b2230;color:var(--acc);font-weight:700}
#tgs .tgs-original tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
#tgs .tgs-original .tag{display:inline-block;background:var(--acc);color:#0d1117;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;border-radius:4px;padding:0 6px;margin-right:6px;vertical-align:1px}
#tgs .tgs-original .tag.warn{background:var(--acc2)}
#tgs .tgs-original{--bg:#f8f6f1;--card:#fffdf9;--line:#e4e7e9;--txt:#263747;--sub:#667889;--acc:#547b9a;--acc2:#b07b5b;--acc3:#4c897a;--acc4:#8d7eac;color:var(--txt);background:var(--bg);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;padding-bottom:35px}
#tgs .tgs-original header{background:linear-gradient(160deg,#eaf1f5,#f8f6f1);margin-bottom:28px}
#tgs .tgs-original .trend .t-no,#tgs .tgs-original .tag,#tgs .tgs-original h2 .no{color:#fff}
#tgs .tgs-original .kpi{flex-wrap:wrap}
#tgs .tgs-original .grid2,#tgs .tgs-original .grid3{min-width:0}
@media(max-width:850px){#tgs .tgs-original .grid2,#tgs .tgs-original .grid3{grid-template-columns:1fr}#tgs .tgs-original .wrap{padding:0 16px}#tgs .tgs-original header h1{font-size:26px}}

/* v13 TGS contrast corrections: preserve original content and light dashboard palette */
#tgs .tgs-original .callout{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff9f1 0%,#fffdf9 100%);color:#263747;border:1px solid #d9b99e;border-left:4px solid #a66b43;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(42,62,78,.04);font-size:15px;line-height:1.9}
#tgs .tgs-original .callout b{color:#985b36;font-weight:750}
#tgs .tgs-original th{background:#eaf1f5;color:#355b78}
#tgs .tgs-original .card,#tgs .tgs-original .trend{color:#263747}
#tgs .tgs-original .trend .t-judge,#tgs .tgs-original .trend .t-ev{color:#263747}
</style><style>
/* v14: Newzoo monthly market observations */
.nz-market-summary,.nz-market-article,.nz-market-takeaway{background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid #dce5eb;border-radius:16px;padding:22px 26px;color:#263b4a;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(43,69,87,.04)}
.nz-market-summary{margin:22px 0 30px;background:#f5f9fb;border-left:4px solid #6d91a6}
.nz-market-kicker{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#54778e;margin-bottom:8px}
.nz-market-summary h3,.nz-market-article h3,.nz-market-takeaway h3{color:#27485c;font-size:19px;line-height:1.5;margin:0 0 10px}
.nz-market-summary p,.nz-market-article p,.nz-market-takeaway p{color:#344b5b;line-height:1.85;font-size:14px;margin:10px 0}
.nz-market-stats{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin:15px 0}
.nz-market-stats span{background:#eaf2f6;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 12px;color:#385569;font-size:13px;flex:1;min-width:180px}
.nz-market-stats b{color:#255779;font-size:19px;margin-right:5px}
.nz-market-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px;margin:18px 0}
.nz-market-intro{color:#587082;font-size:14px;margin:14px 0}
.nz-market-lead{font-weight:700}
.nz-source-link{display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;color:#245f84;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid #8db0c3}
.nz-market-takeaway{background:#f3f7f9;margin:18px 0 28px}
#newzoo-market{scroll-margin-top:24px}
@media(max-width:760px){.nz-market-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.nz-market-summary,.nz-market-article,.nz-market-takeaway{padding:18px}}
</style><style>/* September Steam visual system, adapted to October */
.steam-wrap{padding:28px 0 70px}.steam-title{font-size:30px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.5px}.steam-kicker{font-size:14px;color:var(--text-secondary);margin:5px 0 24px}.steam-kpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:28px}.steam-kpi{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}.steam-kpi b{display:block;font-size:25px;color:var(--accent-warm)}.steam-kpi span{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-tertiary)}.steam-snap{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3D5A6E,#69879A);color:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:24px;margin-bottom:30px}.steam-snap small{font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.72}.steam-snap h2{font-size:20px;margin:8px 0}.steam-snap p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;opacity:.94}.steam-sec{font-size:19px;font-weight:700;margin:30px 0 12px;padding-bottom:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.steam-sec em{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-tertiary);font-style:normal;font-weight:500;margin-left:8px}.steam-focus{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.steam-game{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px 1fr;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}.steam-game img{width:150px;height:100%;min-height:190px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center;display:block;background:var(--surface-muted)}.steam-game-body{padding:14px}.steam-game h3{font-size:14px;margin-bottom:6px}.steam-pills{display:flex;gap:5px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:8px}.steam-pill{font-size:10px;background:var(--surface-muted);border:1px solid var(--border-subtle);border-radius:12px;padding:2px 7px}.steam-path{font-size:13px;font-weight:650;color:var(--accent-blue-deep);padding-top:7px;border-top:1px solid var(--border-subtle)}.steam-score{float:right;font-size:10px;color:var(--text-tertiary);font-weight:500}.steam-note{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-top:7px;line-height:1.55}.steam-table{width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}.steam-table th,.steam-table td{padding:12px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-subtle);text-align:center;font-size:12px}.steam-table th{font-size:10px;color:var(--text-tertiary);background:var(--surface-muted)}.steam-table th:first-child,.steam-table td:first-child{text-align:left}.steam-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}.steam-rank{font-weight:750;color:var(--accent-warm-deep)}.steam-new{font-size:9px;color:var(--accent-blue-deep);display:block}.steam-up{font-size:9px;color:var(--accent-sage);display:block}.steam-weekgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}.steam-week{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:14px}.steam-week h3{font-size:14px;margin-bottom:8px}.steam-week ol{list-style:none;counter-reset:sr}.steam-week li{counter-increment:sr;display:grid;grid-template-columns:20px 58px 1fr auto;gap:7px;align-items:center;padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-subtle);font-size:11px}.steam-week-thumb{width:58px;height:32px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:4px;display:block}.steam-week li:last-child{border:0}.steam-week li:before{content:counter(sr);font-weight:700}.steam-price{color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:10px}.steam-insights{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.steam-insight{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--accent-blue);border-radius:12px;padding:15px}.steam-insight:nth-child(2){border-left-color:var(--accent-sage)}.steam-insight:nth-child(3){border-left-color:var(--accent-warm)}.steam-insight:nth-child(4){border-left-color:var(--accent-lavender)}.steam-insight h4{font-size:13px;margin-bottom:5px}.steam-insight p{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.6}@media(max-width:650px){.steam-kpis{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.steam-focus,.steam-weekgrid,.steam-insights{grid-template-columns:1fr}.steam-game{grid-template-columns:90px 1fr}.steam-game img{width:90px}.steam-table{display:block;overflow-x:auto}}
</style><style>.header-area .report-month{font-size:17px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-secondary);margin:4px 0 10px;letter-spacing:.3px}.header-area h1{margin-bottom:0}</style><style>.strategy-read-note{font-size:13px;color:#627588;background:#f0f4f7;border:1px solid #dbe5ec;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 16px;margin:12px 0 18px;line-height:1.65}#exec-snapshot .exec-body p{line-height:1.78}#exec-snapshot .exec-body strong{display:block;margin-bottom:5px}</style><style>
/* v21: concise six-point executive snapshot */
#exec-snapshot .exec-lead{font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.83);margin:-2px 0 16px}
#exec-snapshot .exec-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px 16px}
#exec-snapshot .exec-point{background:rgba(255,255,255,.095);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.17);border-radius:10px;padding:13px 15px;margin:0;min-width:0}
#exec-snapshot .exec-point strong{display:block;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;color:#fff;margin-bottom:5px}
#exec-snapshot .exec-point-detail{display:block;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.65;color:rgba(255,255,255,.88)}
@media(max-width:740px){#exec-snapshot .exec-body{grid-template-columns:1fr}#exec-snapshot{padding:20px 16px}}
</style></head>
<body>
<div class="container">
<div class="tab-bar">
<button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="summary" onclick="switchTab('summary')">月度概览</button>
<button class="tab-btn" data-tab="newzoo" onclick="switchTab('newzoo')">Newzoo 行业深度研究</button><button class="tab-btn" data-tab="steam" onclick="switchTab('steam')">10月Steam全球热销榜</button>
<button class="tab-btn" data-tab="week1" onclick="switchTab('week1')">第1周</button>
<button class="tab-btn" data-tab="week2" onclick="switchTab('week2')">第2周</button>
<button class="tab-btn" data-tab="week3" onclick="switchTab('week3')">第3周</button>
<button class="tab-btn" data-tab="week4" onclick="switchTab('week4')">第4周</button>
<button class="tab-btn" data-tab="week5" onclick="switchTab('week5')">第5周</button>
</div>
<div class="panel active" id="summary-panel">
<div class="header-area">
<h1>海外游戏行业热点</h1><div class="report-month">2026年10月</div>
<div class="subtitle">基于 GamesIndustry.biz等可靠来源 · 10月精选追踪与趋势分析</div>
<div class="counter-grid">
<div class="counter-card"><div class="number">138</div><div class="label">已收录文章（非全站覆盖率）</div></div>
<div class="counter-card"><div class="number">5</div><div class="label">趋势信号</div></div>
<div class="counter-card"><div class="number">5</div><div class="label">重点事件</div></div>
<div class="counter-card"><div class="number">5</div><div class="label">当月覆盖</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="exec-snapshot" id="exec-snapshot">
<div class="exec-badge">Executive Snapshot</div>
<div class="exec-title">Executive Snapshot · 本月六大核心判断</div><div class="exec-lead">六个信号，一页速览；数据、案例与分析见下方专题。</div>
<div class="exec-body"><p class="exec-point"><strong>01｜玩家更注重购买时机，首发后的销售机会不容忽视</strong><span class="exec-point-detail">Newzoo 调查：84% 的受访核心付费玩家主动寻找折扣，近六成购买发生在首发月之后。</span></p><p class="exec-point"><strong>02｜UGC 平台正成为 IP 长期经营渠道</strong><span class="exec-point-detail">Roblox 上半年 PC/主机游玩时长达 40.5 亿小时（监测的37个市场），品牌合作价值值得持续观察。</span></p><p class="exec-point"><strong>03｜独立游戏与原创 IP 的突破值得重视</strong><span class="exec-point-detail">2026 年部分高销量作品来自新系列，成功不必完全依赖成熟 IP。</span></p><p class="exec-point"><strong>04｜AI 进入游戏开发流程，效率提升与风险管理并重</strong><span class="exec-point-detail">游戏企业探索 AI 辅助开发，同时需要关注版权、内容质量与使用规范。</span></p><p class="exec-point"><strong>05｜行业结构性调整持续，人才与资源配置出现分化</strong><span class="exec-point-detail">部分企业推进裁员及业务重组，同时仍有新工作室成立与重点项目投入。</span></p><p class="exec-point"><strong>06｜大型并购主导交易规模，资本市场复苏仍需审慎判断</strong><span class="exec-point-detail">Q3 报告并购金额为 578 亿美元，其中 EA 相关交易约占 95%；单笔大型交易不代表整体融资回暖。</span></p></div>
</div>
<div class="summary-nav" id="summary-nav">
<div class="nav-item" onclick="scrollToSection('hero-signal')">
<div class="nav-icon">🔥</div>
<div class="nav-title">核心趋势<span class="nav-count">5</span></div>
<div class="nav-desc">AI 进入合规双轨，成本收缩与 IP 集中同步加速</div>
</div>
<div class="nav-item" onclick="scrollToSection('key-events')">
<div class="nav-icon">📅</div>
<div class="nav-title">重点事件<span class="nav-count">5</span></div>
<div class="nav-desc">合并落地、工作室清盘、商店规则改写、IP 授权报价、财报分化五个节点</div>
</div>
<div class="nav-item" onclick="scrollToSection('newzoo-preview')"><div class="nav-icon">📚</div><div class="nav-title">Newzoo 研究 <span class="nav-count">4</span></div><div class="nav-desc">购买行为、Roblox 与两篇月度市场观察</div></div><div class="nav-item" onclick="scrollToSection('strategic-impl')">
<div class="nav-icon">🎯</div>
<div class="nav-title">战略视角 <span class="nav-count">9</span></div>
<div class="nav-desc">编辑分析与业务启示 · 直接阅读，无需点击</div>
</div>
<div class="nav-item" onclick="scrollToSection('market-overview')">
<div class="nav-icon">📈</div>
<div class="nav-title">市场概览<span class="nav-count">138</span></div>
<div class="nav-desc">138 篇文章、5 个信号、5 个事件、8 个维度的数据快照</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="section-h" id="hero-signal">趋势信号<span class="meta-tag">结构性判断</span></div>
<div class="signal-grid"><div class="signal-card dominant" onclick="openDrawer('sig','s1')" style="border-left:3px solid #B0855A"><span class="badge dominant">主导趋势</span><h3>AI 从“试点”进入生产与合规双轨</h3><p>本月 97% 的欧美工作室负责人承认在开发中使用 AI，94% 已覆盖九个制作阶段中的多个环节，采用率不再构成差异化。真正的分水岭出现在治理侧：Capcom 把 AI 嵌进自研 RE Engine 的 QA、调试与数据处…</p></div><div class="signal-card" onclick="openDrawer('sig','s2')" style="border-left:3px solid #5A7A91"><span class="badge recurring">持续趋势</span><h3>组织收缩进入第二轮：从项目裁撤到招牌工作室清盘</h3><p>10 月同时出现三种收缩形态：BioWare 在成立 30 年后关闭、EA 裁撤约 400 个岗位；育碧关闭《Trials》开发商 RedLynx 并裁减新加坡 70 个岗位、在德国三地推行约 100 人的自愿离职；Mi…</p></div><div class="signal-card" onclick="openDrawer('sig','s3')" style="border-left:3px solid #5A7A91"><span class="badge recurring">持续趋势</span><h3>资本向头部资产与跨媒介 IP 双重集中</h3><p>Aream &amp; Co 统计三季度游戏业并购规模达 578 亿美元，其中 EA 的 550 亿美元杠杆收购占绝大多数；Paramount 与 Warner Bros. Discovery 在 Skydance 主导下完成 …</p></div><div class="signal-card" onclick="openDrawer('sig','s4')" style="border-left:3px solid #5A7A91"><span class="badge recurring">持续趋势</span><h3>平台规则重写：分成、披露与定价同时松动的三方博弈</h3><p>Google Play 推出 Game Finder 等发现机制，并向表现突出的作品提供更低服务费；Xbox 把云游戏拆成分层定价，起步 3.99 美元；澳洲联邦法院认定 Apple 限制第三方商店与支付方式违反竞争法，…</p></div><div class="signal-card" onclick="openDrawer('sig','s5')" style="border-left:3px solid #7A9E7D"><span class="badge emerging">新兴趋势</span><h3>独立游戏与原创 IP 的突破：新品也能赢得规模化市场</h3><p>GamesIndustry.biz 的《Indies and original IP blew up in 2026》指出，首月销量超过 50 万份的作品中，过半为新系列开端。比起只强调中型团队如何降本，这一现象更值得追问：原创作品如何依靠清晰的玩法定位、社群传播和产品验证突破既有 IP 的注意力壁垒？早期访问与工具自主是可选路径，而不是成功的唯一解释。</p></div></div>
<div class="section-h" id="key-events">重点事件<span class="meta-tag">本月5个关键节点</span></div>
<div class="events-grid"><div class="event-card" onclick="openDrawer('evt','e1')"><div class="event-date">10月7日<span>重点事件</span></div><h4>Paramount 与 WBD 完成 1110 亿美元合并，游戏部门并入 Skydance</h4><p>交易完成后，Paramount Games Studio 与 WB Games 合并为同一游戏部门，由 Paramount Game Studio 总裁 Tony Driscoll 领导。CEO David Elliso…</p></div><div class="event-card" onclick="openDrawer('evt','e2')"><div class="event-date">10月21日<span>重点事件</span></div><h4>BioWare 在成立 30 年后关闭，EA 裁撤约 400 个岗位</h4><p>EA 确认裁撤约 400 个岗位，其中约 50 个位于 BioWare，这家成立于 1995 年的叙事 RPG 工作室就此终止。同期逾 22.3 万人联署请愿要求 EA“采取果断行动”保住 Mass Effect 系列。…</p></div><div class="event-card" onclick="openDrawer('evt','e3')"><div class="event-date">10月22日<span>重点事件</span></div><h4>澳洲法院认定 Apple 违反竞争法，《Fortnite》重返 iOS</h4><p>澳大利亚联邦法院裁定 Apple 限制第三方应用商店与支付方式以削弱竞争，违反该国竞争法，《Fortnite》据此重返 iOS。这是 Epic 在全球多条战线中少见的实体胜利，但判决的效力限于单一辖区，其他市场的应用商店…</p></div><div class="event-card" onclick="openDrawer('evt','e4')"><div class="event-date">10月26日<span>重点事件</span></div><h4>Netflix 据报 5 亿美元求购 Xbox IP 七年授权遭拒</h4><p>有报道称 Netflix 向 Microsoft 提出 5 亿美元、七年期的 Xbox IP 授权方案，Xbox 方面在要求 8 亿美元后拒绝。同期 Xbox 成立 XP 部门专做影视与主题公园衍生，Paramount …</p></div><div class="event-card" onclick="openDrawer('evt','e5')"><div class="event-date">10月29日<span>重点事件</span></div><h4>Capcom 上半财年数字内容收入增 70.8%，Xbox 硬件季度下滑 14%</h4><p>Capcom 上半财年数字内容部门收入大涨 70.8% 至 5.384 亿美元，由《Onimusha》《Resident Evil》《Pragmata》《Monster Hunter》多 IP 组合拉动；同日 Micro…</p></div></div>
<div class="section-h" id="newzoo-preview">Newzoo 行业深度研究<span class="meta-tag">2份白皮书 · 2篇市场观察</span></div><div class="impl-grid">
<div class="impl-card"><div class="icon">📊</div><h4>游戏购买行为：从首发驱动走向长期经营</h4><p>84% 的受访核心付费玩家主动寻找折扣，近六成购买发生在首发月之外。定价、促销与订阅服务共同塑造购买决策。</p><button class="research-link" onclick="goResearch('purchase')">查看完整研究 →</button></div>
<div class="impl-card"><div class="icon">🎮</div><h4>Roblox 用户成长：下一代游戏消费者与 IP 生态</h4><p>Newzoo 监测的37个市场（不含中国和印度）中，2026年上半年 Roblox 在 PC/主机端游玩时长达40.5亿小时，不含移动端。玩家的社交、创作者和娱乐 IP 偏好值得关注。</p><button class="research-link" onclick="goResearch('roblox')">查看完整研究 →</button></div>
</div><div class="nz-market-summary"><div class="nz-market-kicker">NEWZOO · 月度市场观察</div><h3>新品争夺收入，老游戏通过运营延长生命周期</h3><p>9 月 PC / 主机收入榜显示新品竞争活跃，而成熟游戏继续维持较强玩家参与；万圣节研究则提示，节日需求、订阅、折扣与内容运营可以共同促进经典恐怖游戏回流。</p><div class="nz-market-stats"><span><b>5 / 10</b> 9 月主机收入 Top 10 中的当月新作</span><span><b>60%+</b> 万圣节恐怖游戏活跃增量来自较早发行作品</span></div><button class="research-link" onclick="switchTab('newzoo');setTimeout(function(){document.getElementById('newzoo-market').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'});},90)">查看 Newzoo 月度市场观察 →</button></div><div class="section-h" id="strategic-impl">战略视角<span class="meta-tag">编辑观点 · 直接阅读，无需点击</span></div>
<div class="impl-grid"><div class="impl-card"><div class="icon">🧭</div><h4>AI 治理能力正在成为发行门槛</h4><p>AI 来源、数据授权、外包披露与审核留痕可能影响合作方尽调；是否构成发行门槛取决于具体平台、地区和合作条款。</p></div><div class="impl-card"><div class="icon">✂️</div><h4>编制要可伸缩，而不是可扩张</h4><p>在需求波动较大、外包管理成熟的项目中，可评估核心能力内建与弹性合作相结合的方式；实际成本、知识产权和人才稳定性需要结合项目情况测算。</p></div><div class="impl-card"><div class="icon">🎬</div><h4>先定 IP 授权边界，再排产品档期</h4><p>跨媒介 IP 开发需要先确认授权期限、地域、创作控制权与衍生权益，再结合预算和档期制定合作方案；单一报价传闻不足以推导行业统一价格。</p></div><div class="impl-card"><div class="icon">🧮</div><h4>平台条款要进发行测算模型</h4><p>分成阶梯、AI 披露要求、云串流限额与区域评级各自独立变化，任一变量的调整都可能吞掉原有利润假设，条款应作为产品变量管理。</p></div><div class="impl-card"><div class="icon">🌱</div><h4>原创 IP 的窗口比想象中长</h4><p>首月破 50 万份的作品过半是新系列开端，早期访问把验证前置、开源工具把固定成本转成可变成本，中型团队同时承担创意与技术风险的代价在下降。</p></div><div class="impl-card"><div class="icon">🛡️</div><h4>安全与账号体系是集中化的隐形成本</h4><p>Capcom 1170 万账号、Discord 百万级邮箱、Warhorse 系统入侵在同月发生，账号与数据越集中，单次事件的影响半径越大，业务连续性投入需要前置。</p></div><div class="impl-card impl-card-expanded"><div class="icon">🎮</div><h4>Roblox × 品牌 IP 经营</h4><p><strong>报道线索：</strong>Mattel 讨论 Roblox 发行与网易合作经验；另有研究关注 Roblox 年长玩家留存。</p><p><strong>编辑判断：</strong>可继续观察品牌 IP 如何选择平台、触达不同年龄段玩家，以及合作带来的长期运营价值。</p><a class="focus-source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/players-want-to-engage-with-brands-not-just-consume-them-mattel-on-its-new-game-studios-arm-why-its-releasing-on-roblox-and-what-it-learnt-from-netease" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">阅读原文｜Mattel 谈新游戏部门、为何在 Roblox 发行、以及向网易学到了什么</a><a class="focus-source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/report-explores-how-roblox-can-maintain-older-players-as-it-becomes-most-played-game-by-total-hours-in-h1-2026" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">阅读原文｜报告解析 Roblox 如何留住年长玩家</a></div><div class="impl-card impl-card-expanded"><div class="icon">🌐</div><h4>中国研发团队 × 国际 IP 合作</h4><p><strong>报道线索：</strong>专题报道关注 TiMi 与 Capcom 合作开发《Monster Hunter Outlanders》。</p><p><strong>编辑判断：</strong>可作为跨区域联合研发、IP 授权协作及全球化人才能力建设的案例线索；具体职责分工仍需以原文为准。</p><a class="focus-source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/we-are-very-eager-to-learn-from-the-real-veterans-how-tencents-timi-studio-group-collaborated-with-capcom-on-monster-hunter-outlanders" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">阅读原文｜TiMi 与 Capcom 如何合作开发《Monster Hunter Outlanders》</a></div><div class="impl-card impl-card-expanded"><div class="icon">🚀</div><h4>原创 IP × 早期访问</h4><p><strong>报道线索：</strong>本月收录原创 IP 表现和早期访问开发经验两篇专题。</p><p><strong>编辑判断：</strong>可比较早期验证、发行节奏、团队资源和商业回报；不要仅凭个别成功案例推断整体成功率。</p><a class="focus-source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/indies-and-original-ip-blew-up-in-2026" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">阅读原文｜2026 年独立游戏与原创 IP 全面爆发</a><a class="focus-source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/developers-need-to-treat-early-access-like-a-real-launch-because-players-do-early-access-games-are-on-the-rise-but-so-are-player-expectations" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">阅读原文｜早期访问专题：开发者必须把 EA 当作正式发售对待</a></div></div>
