ss="steam-week-thumb" loading="lazy" src="data:image/webp;base64,"/><span>Dota 2</span><span class="steam-price">免费开玩</span></li><li><img alt="" class="steam-week-thumb" loading="lazy" src="data:image/webp;base64,"/><span>影之刃零</span><span class="steam-price">S$69.90</span></li><li><img alt="" class="steam-week-thumb" loading="lazy" src="data:image/webp;base64,"/><span>Counter-Strike 2</span><span class="steam-price">免费开玩</span></li><li><img alt="" class="steam-week-thumb" loading="lazy" src="data:image/webp;base64,"/><span>赛博朋克 2077</span><span class="steam-price">S$69.00</span></li><li><img alt="" class="steam-week-thumb" loading="lazy" src="data:image/webp;base64,"/><span>AION 2</span><span class="steam-price">免费开玩</span></li><li><img alt="" class="steam-week-thumb" loading="lazy" src="data:image/webp;base64,"/><span>PUBG: BATTLEGROUNDS</span><span class="steam-price">免费开玩</span></li><li><img alt="" class="steam-week-thumb" loading="lazy" src="data:image/webp;base64,"/><span>FINAL FANTASY RESONANCE</span><span class="steam-price">S$67.90</span></li><li><img alt="" class="steam-week-thumb" loading="lazy" src="data:image/webp;base64,"/><span>《赛博朋克 2077：往日之影》</span><span class="steam-price">S$34.99</span></li><li><img alt="" class="steam-week-thumb" loading="lazy" src="data:image/webp;base64,"/><span>EA SPORTS FC™ 27</span><span class="steam-price">S$99.90</span></li></ol></div></div><div class="steam-sec">10月Steam观察 <em>结构性信号</em></div><div class="steam-insights"><div class="steam-insight"><h4>免费长青产品持续进入收入榜</h4><p>Counter-Strike 2、Dota 2、PUBG、AION 2等免费游戏在不同周保持高位，表明免费游戏仍可通过游戏内消费形成可观收入。</p></div><div class="steam-insight"><h4>头部产品的周度位置波动明显</h4><p>四期榜首依次为AION 2、Dota 2、PUBG、Call of Duty®: Modern Warfare® 4；单周第一不等于整月收入第一。</p></div><div class="steam-insight"><h4>新品与成熟产品并行竞争</h4><p>Call of Duty®: Modern Warfare® 4等付费产品与长期运营的免费游戏同时进入前十，体现Steam收入榜的多元构成。</p></div><div class="steam-insight"><h4>口径区分：收入排名不等于销量</h4><p>Steam全球热销榜按收入排序；截图价格为新加坡元显示，且Steam Deck为硬件商品，不宜直接与游戏销售量比较。</p></div></div><div class="steam-note">数据来源：用户上传的Steam全球热销榜截图（2026年9月29日至10月27日）。榜单名称及数据依截图录入，未经独立外部核验；第4期截图额外出现第11名《黎明杀机》，为与9月版本一致的Top 10分析口径，月度统计仅纳入前10名。</div></div></div><div class="panel" id="week1"><div class="filter-bottom"><div class="fchip active" data-filter="all" onclick="applyFilter('week1','all')">全部</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="hotspot" onclick="applyFilter('week1','hotspot')">行业热点</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="finance" onclick="applyFilter('week1','finance')">财报市场数据</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="hr" onclick="applyFilter('week1','hr')">人力资源裁员</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="game" onclick="applyFilter('week1','game')">游戏发行运营</div></div><div class="day-section"><div class="day-header">10月1日</div><div class="article-card" data-cat="finance"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#7A9E7D">财报市场数据</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/pc-and-console-revenue-charts-led-by-new-releases-in-august-newzoo-charts" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>8月PC与主机收入榜由新作领跑（Newzoo）</h4></a><p class="body">Newzoo 公布的 8 月 PC 与主机收入榜前二十由 EA Sports Madden NFL 27、Big Walk、Star Wars Zero Company、Hell Let Loose: Vietnam 等新品占据，新品窗口对单月收入的拉动仍强于长线运营产品。</p><div class="meta">10月1日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/pc-and-console-revenue-charts-led-by-new-releases-in-august-newzoo-charts" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/ubisoft-workers-of-montreal-union-petition-to-preserve-hybrid-work-secures-over-300-signatures" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>育碧蒙特利尔工会请愿保留混合办公，征集超 300 个签名</h4></a><p class="body">工会为“保留混合办公”发起请愿并获得逾 300 个签名，United Videogame Workers Union 公开声援，远程与到岗的边界正从公司政策变成劳资谈判议题。</p><div class="meta">10月1日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/ubisoft-workers-of-montreal-union-petition-to-preserve-hybrid-work-secures-over-300-signatures" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div></div><div class="day-section"><div class="day-header">10月2日</div><div class="article-card" data-cat="game"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B89C5A">游戏发行运营</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/krafton-shuts-down-pubg-spin-off-black-budget-nine-months-after-closed-alpha-test" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Krafton 关闭 PUBG 衍生作 Black Budget，距封测仅九个月</h4></a><p class="body">官方理由是产品“当前方向无法长期为玩家提供可持续体验”，韩国大厂在衍生玩法上的试错周期与容错空间进一步压缩。</p><div class="meta">10月2日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/krafton-shuts-down-pubg-spin-off-black-budget-nine-months-after-closed-alpha-test" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="game"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B89C5A">游戏发行运营</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/2xko-would-have-needed-an-mau-base-in-the-high-hundreds-of-thousands-if-not-millions-to-succeed" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>2XKO 复盘：月活需达数十万乃至百万级才能撑起长线运营</h4></a><p class="body">Riot Games CPO Marc Merrill 表示 2XKO 虽有玩家认可，但用户规模“远不足以”支撑服务型模式，格斗新作进入 live service 的门槛第一次被具体量化。</p><div class="meta">10月2日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/2xko-would-have-needed-an-mau-base-in-the-high-hundreds-of-thousands-if-not-millions-to-succeed" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/reigns-developer-nerial-closes-following-significant-trading-losses-over-past-two-years" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>《Reigns》开发商 Nerial 因连续两年交易亏损关停</h4></a><p class="body">母公司 Devolver 保留既有游戏权利，财报显示工作室 2025 年亏损逾 80 万英镑、2024 年接近 100 万英镑，中小团队的现金缓冲在发行商报表压力下迅速耗尽。</p><div class="meta">10月2日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/reigns-developer-nerial-closes-following-significant-trading-losses-over-past-two-years" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/winners-of-the-uk-best-places-to-work-awards-2026-revealed" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>2026 英国最佳工作场所奖揭晓，25 家公司获奖</h4></a><p class="body">获奖公司因在员工支持上的表现被认可，在裁员与人才竞争并存的年份，雇主品牌开始与融资、发行谈判处在同一权重。</p><div class="meta">10月2日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/winners-of-the-uk-best-places-to-work-awards-2026-revealed" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hotspot"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B0855A">行业热点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/bungie-co-founder-and-destiny-2-narrative-director-launch-transmedia-studio-stone-kite" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Bungie 联合创始人与《命运2》叙事总监创办跨媒介工作室 Stone Kite</h4></a><p class="body">创始人 Margaret Stohl 称团队不做“先做一种媒介再改编”，而是让不同领域创作者同步共建世界观，跨媒介从授权生意变成原生生产结构。</p><div class="meta">10月2日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/bungie-co-founder-and-destiny-2-narrative-director-launch-transmedia-studio-stone-kite" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/quite-often-its-given-me-more-to-do-why-ai-might-be-creating-more-work-for-games-companies-rather-than-saving-time" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>AI 没省时间反而加活：HR 峰会现场反馈</h4></a><p class="body">峰会与会者指出，生成式 AI 的效率收益被员工焦虑、潜在数据泄露与法律纠纷抵消，AI 落地在人力侧的成本被系统性低估。</p><div class="meta">10月2日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/quite-often-its-given-me-more-to-do-why-ai-might-be-creating-more-work-for-games-companies-rather-than-saving-time" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/in-pictures-the-best-places-to-work-awards-2026" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>2026 英国最佳工作场所奖现场图集</h4></a><p class="body">图集记录颁奖当晚的到场者与获奖团队，可作为英国工作室雇主品牌传播的素材参考。</p><div class="meta">10月2日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/in-pictures-the-best-places-to-work-awards-2026" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div></div></div>
<div class="panel" id="week2"><div class="filter-bottom"><div class="fchip active" data-filter="all" onclick="applyFilter('week2','all')">全部</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="hotspot" onclick="applyFilter('week2','hotspot')">行业热点</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="mna" onclick="applyFilter('week2','mna')">融资并购合作</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="finance" onclick="applyFilter('week2','finance')">财报市场数据</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="hr" onclick="applyFilter('week2','hr')">人力资源裁员</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="platform" onclick="applyFilter('week2','platform')">平台政策监管</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="tech" onclick="applyFilter('week2','tech')">技术AI工具链</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="game" onclick="applyFilter('week2','game')">游戏发行运营</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="opinion" onclick="applyFilter('week2','opinion')">社评深度观点</div></div><div class="day-section"><div class="day-header">10月5日</div><div class="article-card" data-cat="tech"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">技术AI工具链</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/capcom-aims-to-enhance-its-propriety-re-engine-with-ai-to-accelerate-efficiency-in-qa-debugging-and-data-processing" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Capcom 用 AI 强化自研 RE Engine，长期剑指“AI 生成式引擎”</h4></a><p class="body">改造目标集中在 QA、调试与数据处理提速，部分改进将开源以支持 AI 训练，长期方向是把 RE Engine 演进为“AI 生成式游戏引擎”。</p><div class="meta">10月5日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/capcom-aims-to-enhance-its-propriety-re-engine-with-ai-to-accelerate-efficiency-in-qa-debugging-and-data-processing" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="mna"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">融资并购合作</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/disney-president-and-cco-dismisses-rumours-of-epic-games-buyout-those-are-not-the-conversations-we-are-having-right-now" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>迪士尼高管否认收购 Epic Games 传闻</h4></a><p class="body">迪士尼总裁兼 CCO 表示“目前没有这类对话”，双方仍以跨媒介内容合作为主，最近的项目是 The Mandalorian and Grogu；大额交易传闻与真实资本动作落差明显。</p><div class="meta">10月5日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/disney-president-and-cco-dismisses-rumours-of-epic-games-buyout-those-are-not-the-conversations-we-are-having-right-now" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="tech"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">技术AI工具链</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/jagex-responds-to-use-of-generative-ai-in-runescape-trailer-made-by-trusted-external-partner" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Jagex 回应《RuneScape》宣传片使用生成式 AI</h4></a><p class="body">该片由“可信赖的外部合作方”制作，Jagex 已下架物料并调查，承认暴露出自家流程漏洞，外包环节的 AI 风险开始回流到发行商品牌。</p><div class="meta">10月5日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/jagex-responds-to-use-of-generative-ai-in-runescape-trailer-made-by-trusted-external-partner" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="opinion"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#D4A574">社评深度观点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/its-less-risky-to-be-the-masters-of-our-own-fate-the-aaa-developers-going-indie" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>大厂老兵转向独立：掌握自己命运的风险更低</h4></a><p class="body">来自 Warner Bros 与 2K 的资深开发者解释，低薪与不确定性仍优于在大厂等待裁员，人才从 AAA 流向独立工作室的迁移在持续。</p><div class="meta">10月5日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/its-less-risky-to-be-the-masters-of-our-own-fate-the-aaa-developers-going-indie" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="tech"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">技术AI工具链</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sony-introduces-ai-upscaling-to-base-ps5-marvels-wolverine-and-ghost-of-yotei-are-first-games-to-implement-new-tech" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Sony 为初代 PS5 引入 AI 超分，《Wolverine》与《Ghost of Yōtei》首批支持</h4></a><p class="body">AI 超分从半代升级专属下放到基础机型，画质竞争开始由算法而非硬件迭代驱动，第三方引擎的适配优先级随之改变。</p><div class="meta">10月5日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sony-introduces-ai-upscaling-to-base-ps5-marvels-wolverine-and-ghost-of-yotei-are-first-games-to-implement-new-tech" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="finance"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#7A9E7D">财报市场数据</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/free-to-play-playtime-is-broadly-flat-as-gacha-rpgs-drive-pc-growth-says-newzoo" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Newzoo：免费游戏时长走平，抽卡 RPG 拉动 PC 增长</h4></a><p class="body">F2P 总时长基本持平，增长集中在抽卡 RPG 品类，说明大盘已进入存量分配阶段，品类间的用户迁移比新增更值得跟踪。</p><div class="meta">10月5日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/free-to-play-playtime-is-broadly-flat-as-gacha-rpgs-drive-pc-growth-says-newzoo" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/ninja-theory-begins-laying-off-staff-according-to-employee-posts" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Ninja Theory 开始裁员</h4></a><p class="body">据员工公开信息，Xbox 曾在两次出售协议落空后于 9 月提出关闭 Hellblade 开发商，本轮裁员是该处置路径的延续，工作室去留仍取决于资产处置结果。</p><div class="meta">10月5日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/ninja-theory-begins-laying-off-staff-according-to-employee-posts" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hotspot"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B0855A">行业热点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/arc-raiders-and-the-finals-are-getting-tv-series-and-film-adaptations" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>《Arc Raiders》与《The Finals》将改编影视</h4></a><p class="body">Chernin 担任主要制片方，项目由 Nexon 旗下 Embark Studios 推进，服务型射击 IP 的影视化窗口正被母公司资本提前锁定。</p><div class="meta">10月5日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/arc-raiders-and-the-finals-are-getting-tv-series-and-film-adaptations" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div></div><div class="day-section"><div class="day-header">10月6日</div><div class="article-card" data-cat="game"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B89C5A">游戏发行运营</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/nba-2k25-servers-to-shut-down-on-december-31-single-player-story-mode-will-become-unplayable" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>NBA 2K25 服务器 12 月 31 日关闭，单机剧情模式随之不可玩</h4></a><p class="body">这是 2K 两年内连续下架 NBA 系列的延续，纯单机内容随服务终止而消失，数字版游戏的“可玩寿命”再次成为消费者权益争议点。</p><div class="meta">10月6日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/nba-2k25-servers-to-shut-down-on-december-31-single-player-story-mode-will-become-unplayable" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="platform"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#8A7FA0">平台政策监管</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/star-wars-galactic-racer-launches-on-amazon-luna-as-part-of-prime-subscription" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>《Star Wars: Galactic Racer》上线 Amazon Luna 并纳入 Prime 订阅</h4></a><p class="body">亚马逊游戏负责人称 Luna 玩家首发即可游玩单机战役，无需主机也无需长时间下载，云游戏正以订阅捆绑方式切入 3A 首发窗口。</p><div class="meta">10月6日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/star-wars-galactic-racer-launches-on-amazon-luna-as-part-of-prime-subscription" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="platform"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#8A7FA0">平台政策监管</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/south-australian-government-makes-largest-investment-in-game-development-by-doubling-its-digital-games-fund-to-1m" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>南澳政府把数字游戏基金翻倍至 100 万美元</h4></a><p class="body">该基金设三条资助通道覆盖制作全周期，是南澳迄今规模最大的游戏产业投入，区域补贴正成为中小工作室融资结构里的稳定项。</p><div class="meta">10月6日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/south-australian-government-makes-largest-investment-in-game-development-by-doubling-its-digital-games-fund-to-1m" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hotspot"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B0855A">行业热点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/brazil-wants-to-be-in-the-top-five-game-producers-in-the-world-in-less-than-10-years" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>巴西提出十年内进入全球前五游戏生产国</h4></a><p class="body">巴西行业机构给出激进目标，当地玩家规模与收入增速确实领先，但人才、发行与资本配套能否同步仍是关键约束。</p><div class="meta">10月6日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/brazil-wants-to-be-in-the-top-five-game-producers-in-the-world-in-less-than-10-years" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="tech"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">技术AI工具链</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sega-wont-entrust-the-creative-aspect-of-games-to-ai-but-is-using-tech-to-improve-efficiency-in-other-departments" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Sega 明确不把创作环节交给 AI</h4></a><p class="body">高级执行董事斎藤刚表示，Sega 对生成式 AI 在开发中的使用“非常谨慎”，只在其他部门用技术提升效率，创意主导权被划为不可外包的边界。</p><div class="meta">10月6日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sega-wont-entrust-the-creative-aspect-of-games-to-ai-but-is-using-tech-to-improve-efficiency-in-other-departments" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="finance"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#7A9E7D">财报市场数据</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/resident-evil-games-engagement-leapt-50-following-release-of-zach-creggers-movie-but-analysts-say-real-value-is-in-brand-building-1" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>《Resident Evil》电影上映后游戏参与度上涨 50%</h4></a><p class="body">与电影同设 Raccoon City 的《Resident Evil 2》日活涨幅尤其明显，分析师认为真正价值在品牌资产的长期积累，而非短期销量脉冲。</p><div class="meta">10月6日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/resident-evil-games-engagement-leapt-50-following-release-of-zach-creggers-movie-but-analysts-say-real-value-is-in-brand-building-1" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div></div><div class="day-section"><div class="day-header">10月7日</div><div class="article-card" data-cat="mna"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">融资并购合作</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/paramount-and-warner-bros-discovery-operating-under-skydance-following-completion-of-111bn-merger" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Paramount 与 Warner Bros. Discovery 在 Skydance 主导下完成 1110 亿美元合并</h4></a><p class="body">CEO David Ellison 提前警告合并将带来“艰难决定”与人员影响，交易完成后内容资产的整合压力会迅速传导到游戏业务线。</p><div class="meta">10月7日 · 新闻<span class="verify-tag">关键事实待复核</span></div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/paramount-and-warner-bros-discovery-operating-under-skydance-following-completion-of-111bn-merger" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hotspot"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B0855A">行业热点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gamesindustrybiz-to-host-panel-at-game-republics-investment-summit-at-mcm-comic-con-october-2026" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>GamesIndustry.biz 将在 MCM Comic Con 投资峰会主持圆桌</h4></a><p class="body">峰会设五场演讲，覆盖游戏融资、开发、可持续工作室建设与原创 IP 的长期价值，英国中小工作室融资成为会议主轴。</p><div class="meta">10月7日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gamesindustrybiz-to-host-panel-at-game-republics-investment-summit-at-mcm-comic-con-october-2026" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="finance"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#7A9E7D">财报市场数据</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/asha-sharma-reportedly-informs-staff-that-xbox-has-started-to-return-to-growth-during-internal-town-hall" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Xbox CEO 内部讲话称业务“已开始恢复增长”</h4></a><p class="body">Asha Sharma 在全员会上表示公司“正在做出正确的再投资决策”，此时 Xbox 仍处大规模重组中，增长叙事与裁员现实同时存在。</p><div class="meta">10月7日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/asha-sharma-reportedly-informs-staff-that-xbox-has-started-to-return-to-growth-during-internal-town-hall" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="tech"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">技术AI工具链</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/unity-unveils-a-web-based-ai-game-creation-platform" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Unity 发布基于网页的 AI 游戏创作平台 Unity Spark</h4></a><p class="body">平台将于年内登陆 Google Playground，把游戏生成能力搬进浏览器，工具链竞争焦点从编辑器转向“零安装加 AI 生成”的入口。</p><div class="meta">10月7日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/unity-unveils-a-web-based-ai-game-creation-platform" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="mna"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">融资并购合作</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/paramount-games-studio-and-wb-games-merge-under-skydance-following-completion-of-111bn-acquisition" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Paramount Games Studio 与 WB Games 在 Skydance 旗下合并</h4></a><p class="body">合并后的游戏部门由 Paramount Game Studio 总裁 Tony Driscoll 领导，1110 亿美元并购完成后，两家发行商的游戏资产收拢进同一决策链。</p><div class="meta">10月7日 · 新闻<span class="verify-tag">关键事实待复核</span></div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/paramount-games-studio-and-wb-games-merge-under-skydance-following-completion-of-111bn-acquisition" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/wizards-of-the-coast-union-expands-demands-company-stop-pushing-generative-ai" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Wizards of the Coast 工会扩容，要求公司停止推进生成式 AI</h4></a><p class="body">D&amp;D 与 Magic: The Gathering 团队加入 Arena 团队已有的工会，AI 使用条款正成为美国游戏工会谈判的核心议题之一。</p><div class="meta">10月7日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/wizards-of-the-coast-union-expands-demands-company-stop-pushing-generative-ai" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/star-wars-zero-company-developer-bit-reactor-begins-bringing-furloughed-staff-back" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>《Star Wars Zero Company》开发商 Bit Reactor 召回停职员工</h4></a><p class="body">有消息称超过半数此前被停职的团队成员已回到薪资名单，项目存续状况改善，但整体规模仍低于停职前水平。</p><div class="meta">10月7日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/star-wars-zero-company-developer-bit-reactor-begins-bringing-furloughed-staff-back" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gravity-well-lays-off-more-than-40-developers-after-losing-its-funding" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Gravity Well 失去融资后裁撤 40 余名开发者</h4></a><p class="body">这家由 Respawn 校友创办的工作室裁掉大部分团队，融资断档直接转化为项目终止，是新工作室最典型的失败路径。</p><div class="meta">10月7日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gravity-well-lays-off-more-than-40-developers-after-losing-its-funding" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div></div><div class="day-section"><div class="day-header">10月8日</div><div class="article-card" data-cat="mna"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">融资并购合作</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/fireshine-games-acquires-necesse-dev-fair-games-described-as-a-defining-moment-for-danish-indie-studio" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Fireshine Games 收购《Necesse》开发商 Fair Games</h4></a><p class="body">交易被称作丹麦独立工作室的“决定性时刻”，创始人称 Necesse 长期在寻找合作方，中小发行商正通过收购长线运营产品补齐自有 IP。</p><div class="meta">10月8日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/fireshine-games-acquires-necesse-dev-fair-games-described-as-a-defining-moment-for-danish-indie-studio" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="mna"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">融资并购合作</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gardens-interactive-founded-by-veterans-behind-journey-and-sky-children-of-the-light-raise-over-35m-in-series-b-funding-round" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Gardens Interactive 完成超 3500 万美元 B 轮融资</h4></a><p class="body">由 Lightspeed Venture Partners 领投，累计融资超过 7000 万美元；由《Journey》《Sky》老兵创办的团队成为今年独立赛道融资规模最高的案例之一。</p><div class="meta">10月8日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gardens-interactive-founded-by-veterans-behind-journey-and-sky-children-of-the-light-raise-over-35m-in-series-b-funding-round" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/hell-let-loose-developer-expression-opens-new-studio-in-manchester-in-response-to-whats-happening-in-the-talent-market" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>《Hell Let Loose》开发商 Expression 在曼彻斯特新设工作室</h4></a><p class="body">官方称此举是“回应人才市场的变化”，仍支持远程办公，但实体办公点被用于匹配联合开发伙伴的要求，混合办公正重塑工作室的地理布局。</p><div class="meta">10月8日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/hell-let-loose-developer-expression-opens-new-studio-in-manchester-in-response-to-whats-happening-in-the-talent-market" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hotspot"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B0855A">行业热点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/xbox-announces-new-xp-division-to-deliver-transmedia-spinoffs-including-film-tv-and-theme-parks" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Xbox 成立 XP 部门，专做影视与主题公园等跨媒介衍生</h4></a><p class="body">部门由前 Mojang 总裁 Kayleen Walters 领导，Mojang 负责人由来自 Reddit 的 Maria Angelidou-Smith 接任，平台方把 IP 授权升级为独立业务单元。</p><div class="meta">10月8日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/xbox-announces-new-xp-division-to-deliver-transmedia-spinoffs-including-film-tv-and-theme-parks" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hotspot"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B0855A">行业热点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/safe-in-our-world-launches-four-billion-players-campaign-to-make-mental-health-support-more-accessible-for-gamers" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Safe In Our World 发起 Four Billion Players 心理健康行动</h4></a><p class="body">该慈善机构呼吁开发商、发行商与平台“把支持放到玩家面前”，玩家心理健康从公益倡议转为产品设计层面的要求。</p><div class="meta">10月8日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/safe-in-our-world-launches-four-billion-players-campaign-to-make-mental-health-support-more-accessible-for-gamers" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="finance"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#7A9E7D">财报市场数据</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/nba-2k27-tops-us-august-charts-becomes-third-best-selling-game-of-2026-us-monthly-charts" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>NBA 2K27 登顶美国 8 月销量榜，成为 2026 年第三畅销作品</h4></a><p class="body">新品占据前五，包括 Madden NFL 27、Marvel Tōkon: Fighting Souls、EA 的 Kickoff 合集与 Star Wars: Zero Company，体育与漫威 IP 仍是美国零售市场的稳定盘。</p><div class="meta">10月8日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/nba-2k27-tops-us-august-charts-becomes-third-best-selling-game-of-2026-us-monthly-charts" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="opinion"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#D4A574">社评深度观点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/a-creative-idea-can-save-more-money-than-ai-can-right-now-glen-schofield-on-his-retirement-callisto-protocols-development-and-the-state-of-aaa" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Glen Schofield 谈退休、《Callisto Protocol》开发与 AAA 现状</h4></a><p class="body">这位《Call of Duty》《Dead Space》老兵表示不把 AI 视为工具，也不认可远程办公，其立场代表了相当一部分传统 AAA 制作人的态度。</p><div class="meta">10月8日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/a-creative-idea-can-save-more-money-than-ai-can-right-now-glen-schofield-on-his-retirement-callisto-protocols-development-and-the-state-of-aaa" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hotspot"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B0855A">行业热点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/mixtape-wins-three-awards-at-australian-game-developer-awards-2026-including-goty" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>《Mixtape》在澳洲游戏开发者奖拿下三奖含年度游戏</h4></a><p class="body">Beethoven &amp; Dinosaur 的作品被评委称作“虚拟叙事的胜利”，区域奖项正成为独立作品进入全球发行视野的跳板。</p><div class="meta">10月8日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/mixtape-wins-three-awards-at-australian-game-developer-awards-2026-including-goty" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div></div><div class="day-section"><div class="day-header">10月9日</div><div class="article-card" data-cat="game"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B89C5A">游戏发行运营</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/ubisoft-announces-shutdown-of-rainbow-six-mobile-seven-months-after-global-launch" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>育碧宣布《Rainbow Six Mobile》全球上线七个月后关服</h4></a><p class="body">官方称团队将转向其他长期战略项目，移动端射击的获客成本与留存门槛在这款产品上被再次验证。</p><div class="meta">10月9日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/ubisoft-announces-shutdown-of-rainbow-six-mobile-seven-months-after-global-launch" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="mna"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">融资并购合作</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/avalanche-studio-group-to-globally-publish-market-and-distribute-titles-from-supermassive-games" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Avalanche Studio Group 将全球发行 Supermassive Games 作品</h4></a><p class="body">Nordisk Game 旗下两家公司保持“完全创作独立”，各自保留产品组合与开发计划的所有权，发行集中化与创作分权同时发生。</p><div class="meta">10月9日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/avalanche-studio-group-to-globally-publish-market-and-distribute-titles-from-supermassive-games" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="mna"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">融资并购合作</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sony-agrees-to-transfer-over-400-global-vr-patents-to-meta-following-december-2025-agreement" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Sony 依 2025 年 12 月协议向 Meta 转让 400 余项 VR 专利</h4></a><p class="body">据报道其中 40 余项已在 6 月至 9 月间售出，VR 专利从防御性资产变为可交易的现金流工具，也说明 Sony 在 VR 硬件上的投入节奏已调整。</p><div class="meta">10月9日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sony-agrees-to-transfer-over-400-global-vr-patents-to-meta-following-december-2025-agreement" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hotspot"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B0855A">行业热点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/paramount-pictures-adapting-live-action-movie-set-in-cyberpunk-2077-universe-co-produced-by-cd-projekt-red" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Paramount 将拍《Cyberpunk 2077》世界观真人电影，CDPR 联合制片</h4></a><p class="body">CDPR 联席 CEO Michał Nowakowski 称 Paramount 是“共享创作野心的未来伙伴”，游戏 IP 影视化从授权走向联合制作。</p><div class="meta">10月9日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/paramount-pictures-adapting-live-action-movie-set-in-cyberpunk-2077-universe-co-produced-by-cd-projekt-red" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/undead-labs-boss-reluctant-to-share-number-affected-by-layoffs-i-would-hate-to-reduce-the-impact-to-those-individuals-to-a-number-or-statistic" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Undead Labs 负责人不愿公开裁员人数</h4></a><p class="body">工作室在 Xbox 重组后转为“员工持股工作室”，负责人 Philip Holt 表示不愿把受影响者的处境简化为一个数字，重组中的信息透明度问题随之浮现。</p><div class="meta">10月9日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/undead-labs-boss-reluctant-to-share-number-affected-by-layoffs-i-would-hate-to-reduce-the-impact-to-those-individuals-to-a-number-or-statistic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div></div></div>
<div class="panel" id="week3"><div class="filter-bottom"><div class="fchip active" data-filter="all" onclick="applyFilter('week3','all')">全部</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="hotspot" onclick="applyFilter('week3','hotspot')">行业热点</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="mna" onclick="applyFilter('week3','mna')">融资并购合作</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="hr" onclick="applyFilter('week3','hr')">人力资源裁员</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="platform" onclick="applyFilter('week3','platform')">平台政策监管</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="tech" onclick="applyFilter('week3','tech')">技术AI工具链</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="game" onclick="applyFilter('week3','game')">游戏发行运营</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="opinion" onclick="applyFilter('week3','opinion')">社评深度观点</div></div><div class="day-section"><div class="day-header">10月12日</div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hotspot"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B0855A">行业热点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/bafta-awards-over-270000-to-112-recipients-in-uk-and-us-to-support-career-growth-in-games-film-and-tv" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>BAFTA 向英美 112 人发放逾 27 万英镑职业发展资助</h4></a><p class="body">资金来自 2026 年 Prince William BAFTA 助学金与奖学金项目，覆盖游戏、电影与电视，是英国人才管道少数仍在扩张的公共支持渠道。</p><div class="meta">10月12日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/bafta-awards-over-270000-to-112-recipients-in-uk-and-us-to-support-career-growth-in-games-film-and-tv" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hotspot"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B0855A">行业热点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/group-behind-gta-6-leaks-threatens-to-release-alleged-full-build-of-game-including-story-mode" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>GTA 6 泄露团伙威胁公开含剧情模式的完整版本</h4></a><p class="body">威胁声明要求“实体光盘与公开道歉”，Take-Two 面对的不只是资产泄露，还有对发行节奏与安全体系的持续施压。</p><div class="meta">10月12日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/group-behind-gta-6-leaks-threatens-to-release-alleged-full-build-of-game-including-story-mode" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="opinion"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#D4A574">社评深度观点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/the-happiest-man-in-gaming-hates-generative-ai" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>《Dwarf Fortress》作者 Tarn Adams 公开反对生成式 AI</h4></a><p class="body">他批评 AI 生成代码臃肿、把电脑变成“吸血鬼”，并讲述靠 Steam 生存的路径，独立开发者对 AI 的态度分化正在加剧。</p><div class="meta">10月12日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/the-happiest-man-in-gaming-hates-generative-ai" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hotspot"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B0855A">行业热点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/game-developer-veteran-chris-kerr-launches-vertical-slice-a-games-publication-giving-workers-a-voice-and-holding-power-to-account" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>资深记者 Chris Kerr 创办新出版物 Vertical Slice</h4></a><p class="body">该媒体完全依靠读者订阅，将提供免费的 pitch 与设计文档库，行业报道的商业模式在收缩期向订阅制迁移。</p><div class="meta">10月12日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/game-developer-veteran-chris-kerr-launches-vertical-slice-a-games-publication-giving-workers-a-voice-and-holding-power-to-account" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="mna"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">融资并购合作</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/aream-co-games-industry-ma-generates-578-bn-in-q3-including-eas-55bn-leveraged-buyout" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Aream &amp; Co：三季度游戏业并购规模达 578 亿美元</h4></a><p class="body">其中包含 EA 550 亿美元的杠杆收购，内容型并购在季度内加速，公开市场收入同比增长 122% 至 13 亿美元，资本重新向头部资产集中。</p><div class="meta">10月12日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/aream-co-games-industry-ma-generates-578-bn-in-q3-including-eas-55bn-leveraged-buyout" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="tech"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">技术AI工具链</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/nvidia-reportedly-ends-geforce-rtx-5090-graphics-card-production" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Nvidia 据报停止 GeForce RTX 5090 生产</h4></a><p class="body">泄露的工厂通知称 RTX 5080 24GB 将成为新的旗舰 GeForce 卡，高端显卡供给收缩会直接影响 PC 端画质与帧率基线。</p><div class="meta">10月12日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/nvidia-reportedly-ends-geforce-rtx-5090-graphics-card-production" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="platform"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#8A7FA0">平台政策监管</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/nintendos-latin-america-vp-says-there-are-no-plans-to-ditch-physical-games" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>任天堂拉美副总裁称没有放弃实体游戏的计划</h4></a><p class="body">Bill van Zyll 表示实体与数字的取舍由消费者偏好决定，在多家平台推进纯数字化的时点，任天堂的实体策略成为渠道商的重要变量。</p><div class="meta">10月12日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/nintendos-latin-america-vp-says-there-are-no-plans-to-ditch-physical-games" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="platform"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#8A7FA0">平台政策监管</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/discord-protection-bot-double-counter-hit-by-breach-exposing-around-1-million-email-addresses" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Discord 防护机器人 Double Counter 遭入侵，约 100 万邮箱泄露</h4></a><p class="body">Discord 已就数据泄露作出回应，第三方安全工具的权限边界与平台生态的信任成本被再次放大。</p><div class="meta">10月12日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/discord-protection-bot-double-counter-hit-by-breach-exposing-around-1-million-email-addresses" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="tech"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">技术AI工具链</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/dragon-quest-creator-yuji-horii-releases-game-he-says-he-made-with-ai-in-about-30-minutes" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>《Dragon Quest》之父堀井雄二发布约 30 分钟用 AI 做出的游戏</h4></a><p class="body">他表示 AI 让不会画画、不会编程的人也能独立做出像样的作品，创作门槛下降对个人开发者与小型团队的产能结构影响直接。</p><div class="meta">10月12日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/dragon-quest-creator-yuji-horii-releases-game-he-says-he-made-with-ai-in-about-30-minutes" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="tech"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">技术AI工具链</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/epic-games-delays-disney-game-and-tells-developers-to-go-ai-first" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Epic 推迟迪士尼题材新作并要求团队“AI 优先”</h4></a><p class="body">这款含 Marvel 与 Star Wars 角色的射击游戏原定 3 月上线，延期与“AI first”指令同时出现，大厂正把 AI 纳入排期而非仅作试验。</p><div class="meta">10月12日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/epic-games-delays-disney-game-and-tells-developers-to-go-ai-first" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div></div><div class="day-section"><div class="day-header">10月13日</div><div class="article-card" data-cat="tech"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">技术AI工具链</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/years-of-building-pitching-and-raising-for-games-made-the-same-failure-painful-to-watch-why-gamedatacore-wants-to-find-out-how-players-feel" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>GameDataCore 用 Steam 评论分析玩家情绪</h4></a><p class="body">这家布莱顿创业公司的平台通过评论数据判断玩家真实反馈，帮工作室决定下一步做什么，发行决策开始从经验判断转向文本数据挖掘。</p><div class="meta">10月13日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/years-of-building-pitching-and-raising-for-games-made-the-same-failure-painful-to-watch-why-gamedatacore-wants-to-find-out-how-players-feel" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hotspot"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B0855A">行业热点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/xbox-announces-xbox-labs-a-new-initiative-to-trial-emerging-ideas-and-new-technology" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Xbox 成立 Xbox Labs，专门试验新想法与“新技术”</h4></a><p class="body">新团队由现有员工组成，以用户反馈作为项目去留标准，平台方在重组期仍保留小规模创新试验的组织空间。</p><div class="meta">10月13日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/xbox-announces-xbox-labs-a-new-initiative-to-trial-emerging-ideas-and-new-technology" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div></div><div class="day-section"><div class="day-header">10月14日</div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hotspot"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B0855A">行业热点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/xbox-ceo-reportedly-warns-firm-will-not-survive-if-it-only-relies-on-existing-franchises" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Xbox CEO 警告：只靠既有 IP 公司将“无法生存”</h4></a><p class="body">内部表态要求团队“找到新方式与勇气”，用新 IP 触达新人群，与同期的大规模人员调整构成同一套资源配置逻辑的两面。</p><div class="meta">10月14日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/xbox-ceo-reportedly-warns-firm-will-not-survive-if-it-only-relies-on-existing-franchises" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/ubisoft-closing-trials-developer-redlynx-and-cutting-jobs-in-singapore-studio" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>育碧关闭《Trials》开发商 RedLynx 并裁减新加坡团队</h4></a><p class="body">最新一轮调整拟在芬兰削减 52 个岗位、新加坡削减 70 个，育碧的成本收缩从零星工作室蔓延到区域节点。</p><div class="meta">10月14日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/ubisoft-closing-trials-developer-redlynx-and-cutting-jobs-in-singapore-studio" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="platform"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#8A7FA0">平台政策监管</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/esa-flags-retro-console-maker-anbernic-for-inclusion-on-us-governments-notorious-market-list" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>ESA 将复古主机厂商 Anbernic 列入美国政府“恶名市场”名单</h4></a><p class="body">贸易团体称 Anbernic “通过精致产品把盗版硬件正常化”，硬件形态的版权争议进入贸易政策视野。</p><div class="meta">10月14日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/esa-flags-retro-console-maker-anbernic-for-inclusion-on-us-governments-notorious-market-list" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="game"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B89C5A">游戏发行运营</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/rockstars-next-game-wont-take-eight-years-to-make-the-engine-the-tools-and-the-team-weve-built-during-gta-6-will-allow-us-to-do-things-more-quickly" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Rockstar 称下一款游戏不会再花八年</h4></a><p class="body">团队自 2018 年《Red Dead Redemption 2》以来规模翻倍，超过 4000 人投入开发与 QA，GTA 6 沉淀的引擎、工具与团队被视作下一作的加速器。</p><div class="meta">10月14日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/rockstars-next-game-wont-take-eight-years-to-make-the-engine-the-tools-and-the-team-weve-built-during-gta-6-will-allow-us-to-do-things-more-quickly" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="platform"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#8A7FA0">平台政策监管</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/casual-game-marketplace-legacy-games-to-close-online-store-this-december" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>休闲游戏平台 Legacy Games 将于 12 月关闭在线商店</h4></a><p class="body">2027 年 2 月 28 日起玩家无法重新下载已购买内容，与其“永久拥有”的宣传口径冲突，数字商店退场时的消费者权益问题被再次暴露。</p><div class="meta">10月14日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/casual-game-marketplace-legacy-games-to-close-online-store-this-december" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="opinion"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#D4A574">社评深度观点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/i-wanted-to-make-the-show-i-wanted-to-watch-how-galaxies-found-a-place-in-the-crowded-showcase-landscape" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Galaxies 创始人谈如何在拥挤的发布会生态中立足</h4></a><p class="body">Chris Thomas 用“tapas 式”策展试图重现 E3 的现场感，中小型展示会在夏季档期之外找到了自己的位置。</p><div class="meta">10月14日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/i-wanted-to-make-the-show-i-wanted-to-watch-how-galaxies-found-a-place-in-the-crowded-showcase-landscape" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/funcom-to-lay-off-staff-as-it-pivots-to-focusing-solely-on-conan-exiles-and-dune-awakening" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Funcom 裁员并将业务收缩至《Conan Exiles》与《Dune: Awakening》</h4></a><p class="body">任职 22 年的 CEO Rui Casais 将在重组“困难阶段”结束后离开，由 Scott Junior 接任，腾讯旗下工作室的聚焦策略以人事更替收尾。</p><div class="meta">10月14日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/funcom-to-lay-off-staff-as-it-pivots-to-focusing-solely-on-conan-exiles-and-dune-awakening" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="platform"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#8A7FA0">平台政策监管</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sbox-plans-to-go-free-to-play-and-embrace-human-curation-saying-netflix-for-games-doesnt-work" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>S&amp;box 计划转为免费并回归人工策展，称“游戏界 Netflix 行不通”</h4></a><p class="body">Facepunch 创始人 Garry Newman 承认平台在评价与留存上遇到困难，UGC 平台的算法推荐模式正在被人工运营取代。</p><div class="meta">10月14日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sbox-plans-to-go-free-to-play-and-embrace-human-curation-saying-netflix-for-games-doesnt-work" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hotspot"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B0855A">行业热点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/duke-nukem-3d-level-designer-richard-levelord-gray-dies-aged-68" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>《Duke Nukem 3D》关卡设计师 Richard “Levelord” Gray 逝世</h4></a><p class="body">这位参与创立多家工作室的关卡设计先驱离世，90 年代 FPS 关卡设计方法论的主要奠基者之一就此谢幕。</p><div class="meta">10月14日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/duke-nukem-3d-level-designer-richard-levelord-gray-dies-aged-68" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="platform"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#8A7FA0">平台政策监管</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/google-play-adds-game-finder-sprints-and-sidekick-playbacks-in-discovery-push" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Google Play 推出 Game Finder、Sprints 与 Sidekick Playbacks</h4></a><p class="body">平台同时扩展 Quests 与 PC 游戏业务，并向表现突出的作品提供更低服务费，安卓渠道用发现机制与分成让利争夺优质内容。</p><div class="meta">10月14日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/google-play-adds-game-finder-sprints-and-sidekick-playbacks-in-discovery-push" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div></div><div class="day-section"><div class="day-header">10月15日</div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/ubisoft-to-reduce-workforce-across-dusseldorf-berlin-and-mainz-as-part-of-proposed-voluntary-departure-plan" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>育碧将在杜塞尔多夫、柏林与美因茨推行“自愿离职计划”</h4></a><p class="body">约 100 名员工可能受影响，公司称此举是为“让德国工作室在未来处于最佳位置”，欧洲成本结构调整从英国扩展到德国。</p><div class="meta">10月15日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/ubisoft-to-reduce-workforce-across-dusseldorf-berlin-and-mainz-as-part-of-proposed-voluntary-departure-plan" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="tech"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">技术AI工具链</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/epic-games-claims-its-new-vibe-coded-launcher-runs-46-faster-than-steam-from-cold-start-to-store-page" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Epic 称“氛围编码”的新启动器冷启动到商店页比 Steam 快 46%</h4></a><p class="body">官方表示 AI 作为开发工具“让小团队重写代码库并更快跨平台上线”，AI 辅助工程开始出现在与平台对手直接对标的性能宣传里。</p><div class="meta">10月15日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/epic-games-claims-its-new-vibe-coded-launcher-runs-46-faster-than-steam-from-cold-start-to-store-page" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="platform"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#8A7FA0">平台政策监管</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/house-house-will-not-release-big-walk-on-xbox-in-support-of-pro-palestinian-bds-campaign" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>House House 为支持 BDS 运动不在 Xbox 发行《Big Walk》</h4></a><p class="body">工作室表示希望玩家能在 Xbox 上玩到，但在 Microsoft 或 Xbox 被移出抵制名单前不会发行，独立团队正把平台选择变成政治表态。</p><div class="meta">10月15日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/house-house-will-not-release-big-walk-on-xbox-in-support-of-pro-palestinian-bds-campaign" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="opinion"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#D4A574">社评深度观点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/an-oral-history-of-the-tomb-raider-game-no-one-wanted-to-make" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>无人愿意制作的《Tomb Raider》口述史</h4></a><p class="body">《Tomb Raider Chronicles》当年为 Eidos 的财报被批准立项，设计团队对此不满，这段历史揭示发行商财务节奏如何直接决定产品命运。</p><div class="meta">10月15日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/an-oral-history-of-the-tomb-raider-game-no-one-wanted-to-make" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="game"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B89C5A">游戏发行运营</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/reforj-developer-4j-studios-announces-pc-release-date-at-game-republic-new-horizons" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>4J Studios 公布《Reforj》PC 版日期</h4></a><p class="body">这款开放世界生存沙盒将于 2027 年一季度开启封闭测试，长期运营型沙盒仍是中型工作室押注的主要方向。</p><div class="meta">10月15日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/reforj-developer-4j-studios-announces-pc-release-date-at-game-republic-new-horizons" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="tech"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">技术AI工具链</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/dayz-creator-dean-hall-releases-open-source-game-development-framework-brutal" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>《DayZ》作者 Dean Hall 发布开源开发框架 Brutal</h4></a><p class="body">他认为 Unity 与 Unreal “一直没有对创作者承担责任”，开源框架的出现把引擎议价权问题推到台面。</p><div class="meta">10月15日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/dayz-creator-dean-hall-releases-open-source-game-development-framework-brutal" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div></div><div class="day-section"><div class="day-header">10月16日</div><div class="article-card" data-cat="game"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B89C5A">游戏发行运营</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sega-and-creative-assembly-remove-total-war-shogun-2-remaster-from-sale-as-it-falls-short-of-both-your-expectations-and-our-own-standards" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Sega 与 Creative Assembly 下架《Total War: Shogun 2》重制版</h4></a><p class="body">官方承认产品“未达到玩家与自身的标准”，Steam 评价压倒性负面，玩家主要质疑 AI 超分与性能表现，重制策略的质量门槛被抬高。</p><div class="meta">10月16日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sega-and-creative-assembly-remove-total-war-shogun-2-remaster-from-sale-as-it-falls-short-of-both-your-expectations-and-our-own-standards" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/fishlabs-announces-layoffs-due-to-changing-project-requirements-development-and-support-teams-affected" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Fishlabs 因“项目需求变化”裁员，开发与支持团队受影响</h4></a><p class="body">受影响人数未披露，工作室称仍将履行合作项目承诺，外包型团队在项目切换期的用工弹性问题突出。</p><div class="meta">10月16日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/fishlabs-announces-layoffs-due-to-changing-project-requirements-development-and-support-teams-affected" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hotspot"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B0855A">行业热点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/game-republic-new-horizons-2026-attendance-grew-76-to-over-461-visitors" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Game Republic New Horizons 2026 到场人数增长 78% 至 461 人</h4></a><p class="body">超过 100 人从伦敦与东南部前往米德尔斯堡参会，英国区域型开发者会议在行业收缩期反而获得增长。</p><div class="meta">10月16日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/game-republic-new-horizons-2026-attendance-grew-76-to-over-461-visitors" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="game"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B89C5A">游戏发行运营</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/the-netflix-series-drive-to-survive-inspired-star-wars-galactic-racer" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Netflix 纪录片《Drive to Survive》影响了《Star Wars: Galactic Racer》的设计</h4></a><p class="body">Fuse Games 负责人 Matt Webster 称团队想复刻 F1 节目里赛道之外的故事张力，影视叙事方法被直接引入竞速游戏设计。</p><div class="meta">10月16日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/the-netflix-series-drive-to-survive-inspired-star-wars-galactic-racer" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hotspot"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B0855A">行业热点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gamescom-asia-x-thailand-game-show-2026-announces-four-additional-pavilions-from-indonesia-japan-malaysia-and-the-us" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Gamescom Asia x Thailand Game Show 2026 新增四个国家馆</h4></a><p class="body">本届覆盖 29 个国家和地区，被称为主办史上“最国际化”的一届，东南亚展会的国际代表性快速提升。</p><div class="meta">10月16日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gamescom-asia-x-thailand-game-show-2026-announces-four-additional-pavilions-from-indonesia-japan-malaysia-and-the-us" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="opinion"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#D4A574">社评深度观点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/how-star-wars-galactic-racer-kept-the-core-team-small-and-sustainable-through-distributed-development" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>《Star Wars: Galactic Racer》如何用“分布式开发”保持小核心团队</h4></a><p class="body">制作方称团队收缩虽会伤害个人，但知识流失的代价更昂贵，分布式协作成为中型工作室在成本与产能之间的折中方案。</p><div class="meta">10月16日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/how-star-wars-galactic-racer-kept-the-core-team-small-and-sustainable-through-distributed-development" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div></div></div>
<div class="panel" id="week4"><div class="filter-bottom"><div class="fchip active" data-filter="all" onclick="applyFilter('week4','all')">全部</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="hotspot" onclick="applyFilter('week4','hotspot')">行业热点</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="mna" onclick="applyFilter('week4','mna')">融资并购合作</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="finance" onclick="applyFilter('week4','finance')">财报市场数据</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="hr" onclick="applyFilter('week4','hr')">人力资源裁员</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="platform" onclick="applyFilter('week4','platform')">平台政策监管</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="tech" onclick="applyFilter('week4','tech')">技术AI工具链</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="opinion" onclick="applyFilter('week4','opinion')">社评深度观点</div></div><div class="day-section"><div class="day-header">10月19日</div><div class="article-card" data-cat="tech"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">技术AI工具链</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/the-ai-state-of-play-ai-laws-and-game-development" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>AI 现状盘点：AI 法规如何影响游戏开发</h4></a><p class="body">文章梳理表演、广告等环节的法律变化对工作室的实际影响，AI 合规从法务议题变成制作流程中的固定成本项。</p><div class="meta">10月19日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/the-ai-state-of-play-ai-laws-and-game-development" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="platform"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#8A7FA0">平台政策监管</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/ukie-partners-with-sheridans-on-ai-compliance-and-accreditation-service-to-guide-uk-studios-in-using-ai-lawfully-and-responsibly" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>UKIE 与 Sheridans 合作推出 AI 合规与认证服务</h4></a><p class="body">四步流程最终给出可在路演中展示的 AI 认证标识，英国工作室的 AI 使用开始拥有可对外证明的合规凭证。</p><div class="meta">10月19日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/ukie-partners-with-sheridans-on-ai-compliance-and-accreditation-service-to-guide-uk-studios-in-using-ai-lawfully-and-responsibly" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hotspot"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B0855A">行业热点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/new-croatian-conference-splitscreen-wants-to-keep-that-half-holiday-half-work-feeling-of-reboot-develop" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>克罗地亚新会议 Splitscreen 想延续 Reboot Develop 的氛围</h4></a><p class="body">这场落户斯普利特的活动主打海滨场地、AAA 与独立混合的国际受众，并明确不设会议 App，区域会议在用“反效率”定位吸引开发者。</p><div class="meta">10月19日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/new-croatian-conference-splitscreen-wants-to-keep-that-half-holiday-half-work-feeling-of-reboot-develop" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/activision-qa-united-cwa-union-vote-to-authorise-strike-claims-publisher-has-failed-to-bargain-in-good-faith-over-key-issues" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Activision QA United-CWA 工会投票授权罢工</h4></a><p class="body">工会称发行商在关键议题上“未诚意谈判”，成员已准备采取行动争取合同、薪资与工作条件，美国游戏业罢工风险实质上升。</p><div class="meta">10月19日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/activision-qa-united-cwa-union-vote-to-authorise-strike-claims-publisher-has-failed-to-bargain-in-good-faith-over-key-issues" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hotspot"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B0855A">行业热点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gdca-2027-moves-away-from-nominations-based-system-publishers-and-devs-can-now-submit-games-for-consideration" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>GDCA 2027 取消提名制，开发者与发行商可直接提交作品</h4></a><p class="body">参评作品须在 2026 年内于 PC 或主机发售，评奖机制向开放投稿靠拢，奖项公信力与参评覆盖面的平衡被重新设计。</p><div class="meta">10月19日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gdca-2027-moves-away-from-nominations-based-system-publishers-and-devs-can-now-submit-games-for-consideration" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/wizards-of-the-coast-declines-to-voluntarily-recognize-dd-and-studio-x-union-drive" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Wizards of the Coast 拒绝自愿承认 D&amp;D 与 Studio X 工会</h4></a><p class="body">相关团队将进入美国劳资关系委员会的选举程序，工会化路径从自愿承认转向正式投票。</p><div class="meta">10月19日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/wizards-of-the-coast-declines-to-voluntarily-recognize-dd-and-studio-x-union-drive" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="platform"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#8A7FA0">平台政策监管</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/pegi-begins-moving-existing-digital-only-games-with-loot-boxes-up-to-a-16-rating" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>PEGI 将含开箱的既有数字游戏评级上调至 16</h4></a><p class="body">原为 PEGI 3、7、12 的作品受影响，更新在 10 月内分批推进，欧洲评级体系对随机付费机制的立场明显收紧。</p><div class="meta">10月19日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/pegi-begins-moving-existing-digital-only-games-with-loot-boxes-up-to-a-16-rating" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div></div><div class="day-section"><div class="day-header">10月20日</div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/samson-studio-liquid-swords-files-for-bankruptcy-staff-reportedly-unpaid-for-two-months" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Liquid Swords CEO 确认破产程序后工作室关闭</h4></a><p class="body">创始人在公告中称已尽力而为并为团队成果自豪，成立不久即依赖单一项目的工作室在融资收紧时几乎没有缓冲。</p><div class="meta">10月20日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/samson-studio-liquid-swords-files-for-bankruptcy-staff-reportedly-unpaid-for-two-months" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hotspot"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B0855A">行业热点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gdc-festival-of-gaming-2027-moves-to-four-day-format-to-create-a-higher-quality-more-focused-and-valuable-experience" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>GDC Festival of Gaming 2027 改为四天制</h4></a><p class="body">主办方称将把内容与机会集中在社区最活跃的时段，大型行业会议在参会成本上升的背景下开始压缩会期、提高单位时间密度。</p><div class="meta">10月20日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gdc-festival-of-gaming-2027-moves-to-four-day-format-to-create-a-higher-quality-more-focused-and-valuable-experience" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="finance"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#7A9E7D">财报市场数据</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sensor-tower-data-shows-the-yawning-gap-between-gta-6-and-everything-else" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Sensor Tower：GTA 6 预售领先同期《Modern Warfare 2》148%</h4></a><p class="body">数据显示 Rockstar 新作的预购规模与其他产品之间存在“巨大鸿沟”，头部产品的预售集中度正在压缩同期竞品的窗口。</p><div class="meta">10月20日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sensor-tower-data-shows-the-yawning-gap-between-gta-6-and-everything-else" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="platform"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#8A7FA0">平台政策监管</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/japan-actors-union-announces-guidelines-addressing-unauthorised-use-of-generative-ai-for-voice-acting" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>日本演员联合会发布生成式 AI 声音使用指引</h4></a><p class="body">指引强调“活着的人类表达”与“对权利的尊重”必须保留在核心位置，配音授权成为 AI 立法之外行业自律的第一道防线。</p><div class="meta">10月20日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/japan-actors-union-announces-guidelines-addressing-unauthorised-use-of-generative-ai-for-voice-acting" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="opinion"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#D4A574">社评深度观点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/players-want-to-engage-with-brands-not-just-consume-them-mattel-on-its-new-game-studios-arm-why-its-releasing-on-roblox-and-what-it-learnt-from-netease" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Mattel 谈新游戏部门、为何在 Roblox 发行、以及向网易学到了什么</h4></a><p class="body">负责人 Marcus Liassides 强调玩具公司做游戏不是短期试水，品牌方要求玩家“参与而非消费”，IP 方的自研游戏能力正在增强。</p><div class="meta">10月20日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/players-want-to-engage-with-brands-not-just-consume-them-mattel-on-its-new-game-studios-arm-why-its-releasing-on-roblox-and-what-it-learnt-from-netease" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="mna"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">融资并购合作</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/griffin-gaming-partners-and-entertainment-360-launch-new-company-to-support-video-game-adaptations-for-film-and-tv" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Griffin Gaming Partners 与 Entertainment 360 成立 HITpoint 推动游戏影视化</h4></a><p class="body">新公司将开发发行关系与 IP 改编制作能力结合，影视资本开始以合资公司形式系统化承接游戏 IP。</p><div class="meta">10月20日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/griffin-gaming-partners-and-entertainment-360-launch-new-company-to-support-video-game-adaptations-for-film-and-tv" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div></div><div class="day-section"><div class="day-header">10月21日</div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/demystifying-unions-what-games-leaders-need-to-know" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>解读工会：游戏管理者需要知道什么</h4></a><p class="body">文章汇集本月 HR 峰会上工会代表的观点，管理层对工会化的认知缺口正在成为劳资冲突的直接诱因。</p><div class="meta">10月21日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/demystifying-unions-what-games-leaders-need-to-know" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="tech"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">技术AI工具链</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/vivrato-97-of-studio-leaders-use-ai-in-some-form-during-development-in-eu-and-north-america" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Vivrato：欧美 97% 工作室负责人在开发中使用 AI</h4></a><p class="body">其中 94% 已在九个制作阶段中应用 AI，采用率接近饱和，真正的差异转移到治理、版权与质量控制能力上。</p><div class="meta">10月21日 · 新闻<span class="verify-tag">关键事实待复核</span></div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/vivrato-97-of-studio-leaders-use-ai-in-some-form-during-development-in-eu-and-north-america" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="finance"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#7A9E7D">财报市场数据</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/games-like-call-of-duty-and-ea-sports-fc-most-at-risk-of-losing-players-during-gta-6-launch-according-to-new-data" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>《Call of Duty》与《EA Sports FC》在 GTA 6 发售期流失玩家风险最高</h4></a><p class="body">咨询公司 Open World 评估了各用户群的迁移概率并给出开发者的应对建议，头部产品的档期外溢效应开始被量化管理。</p><div class="meta">10月21日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/games-like-call-of-duty-and-ea-sports-fc-most-at-risk-of-losing-players-during-gta-6-launch-according-to-new-data" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="opinion"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#D4A574">社评深度观点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/indies-and-original-ip-blew-up-in-2026" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>2026 年独立游戏与原创 IP 全面爆发</h4></a><p class="body">首月销量超过 50 万份的作品中过半是新系列的开端，原创 IP 的商业上限在今年的数据中被重新确认。</p><div class="meta">10月21日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/indies-and-original-ip-blew-up-in-2026" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="tech"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">技术AI工具链</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/project-helix-reportedly-launching-in-late-2028-projected-to-cost-between-1200-and-1800" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Project Helix 据报 2028 年末上市，预计售价 1200 至 1800 美元</h4></a><p class="body">报道同时称 Xbox 计划明年推下一代掌机，硬件成本上行与产品线扩张同步发生，换代的价格门槛可能显著抬高。</p><div class="meta">10月21日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/project-helix-reportedly-launching-in-late-2028-projected-to-cost-between-1200-and-1800" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="tech"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">技术AI工具链</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/amds-fsr-41-upscaling-is-coming-to-xbox-series-xs" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>AMD FSR 4.1 超分将登陆 Xbox Series X|S</h4></a><p class="body">Microsoft 与 AMD 已宣布该机器学习技术适配现役主机，但未给出时间表，主机端超分方案进入同代硬件内的持续迭代。</p><div class="meta">10月21日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/amds-fsr-41-upscaling-is-coming-to-xbox-series-xs" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/bioware-is-closing-after-30-years" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>BioWare 在成立 30 年后关闭，EA 裁撤约 400 个岗位</h4></a><p class="body">其中包括 BioWare 内部约 50 人，老牌叙事工作室的终结标志着 EA 对高成本单机 RPG 生产模式的重新取舍。</p><div class="meta">10月21日 · 新闻<span class="verify-tag">关键事实待复核</span></div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/bioware-is-closing-after-30-years" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div></div><div class="day-section"><div class="day-header">10月22日</div><div class="article-card" data-cat="platform"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#8A7FA0">平台政策监管</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/fortnite-returns-to-ios-in-australia-after-court-rules-apple-violated-competition-law" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>澳洲法院认定 Apple 违反竞争法，《Fortnite》重返 iOS</h4></a><p class="body">联邦法院认定 Apple 限制第三方应用商店与支付方式以削弱竞争，Epic 在单一市场取得突破，但区域判决的全球外溢仍有限。</p><div class="meta">10月22日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/fortnite-returns-to-ios-in-australia-after-court-rules-apple-violated-competition-law" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="platform"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#8A7FA0">平台政策监管</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/xbox-reveals-pricing-for-cloud-gaming-limits-starting-at-399-for-10-hours" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Xbox 公布云游戏分层定价，起步价 3.99 美元</h4></a><p class="body">云游戏从订阅权益拆分为可单独购买的限额产品，平台开始对串流时长本身计价，云成本向用户侧转移。</p><div class="meta">10月22日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/xbox-reveals-pricing-for-cloud-gaming-limits-starting-at-399-for-10-hours" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="opinion"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#D4A574">社评深度观点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/how-pantaloon-is-curating-an-evolving-library-of-bold-and-bizarre-games-with-its-new-subscription-service" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Pantaloon 谈如何用订阅服务策划“大胆而怪异的游戏库”</h4></a><p class="body">联合创始人 Jamin Smith 把 Playbill 描述为一系列“疯狂实验”中的最新一个，小型订阅曲库在算法分发之外寻找策展价值。</p><div class="meta">10月22日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/how-pantaloon-is-curating-an-evolving-library-of-bold-and-bizarre-games-with-its-new-subscription-service" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="finance"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#7A9E7D">财报市场数据</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/report-explores-how-roblox-can-maintain-older-players-as-it-becomes-most-played-game-by-total-hours-in-h1-2026" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>报告解析 Roblox 如何留住年长玩家</h4></a><p class="body">Newzoo 调查显示，Roblox 16+ 玩家过去六个月在任意游戏中有过消费的比例为80%，非 Roblox 玩家为59%。这是不同玩家群体的差异，不能直接推断 Roblox 促成更高付费或证明其商业模型已改变。</p><div class="meta">10月22日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/report-explores-how-roblox-can-maintain-older-players-as-it-becomes-most-played-game-by-total-hours-in-h1-2026" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="finance"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#7A9E7D">财报市场数据</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/marvels-wolverine-leads-us-september-charts-achieves-highest-monthly-dollar-sales-for-a-sony-published-title-since-helldivers-2" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>《Marvel's Wolverine》登顶美国 9 月榜，创 Sony 发行作品新纪录</h4></a><p class="body">Circana 数据显示 PS5 支出同比增长 43%、销量增长 22%，该作创下自《Helldivers 2》以来 Sony 发行作品的最高单月销售额。</p><div class="meta">10月22日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/marvels-wolverine-leads-us-september-charts-achieves-highest-monthly-dollar-sales-for-a-sony-published-title-since-helldivers-2" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="opinion"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#D4A574">社评深度观点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/it-was-crushing-how-hard-it-was-the-chaotic-development-of-dispatch-and-what-adhoc-studio-plans-next" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>《Dispatch》的混乱开发历程与 AdHoc Studio 的下一步</h4></a><p class="body">CEO Michael Choung 谈 Steam 带来的助推、角色塑造的重要性以及艰难的融资谈判，小型叙事团队的生存依赖平台窗口与口碑叠加。</p><div class="meta">10月22日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/it-was-crushing-how-hard-it-was-the-chaotic-development-of-dispatch-and-what-adhoc-studio-plans-next" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div></div><div class="day-section"><div class="day-header">10月23日</div><div class="article-card" data-cat="opinion"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#D4A574">社评深度观点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/podcast-landfalls-rebecca-lautner-on-peaks-23-million-sales-and-looking-past-friendslop" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>播客：Landfall 的 Rebecca Lautner 谈《Peak》2300 万销量</h4></a><p class="body">访谈还解释了 Landfall 为何只用一个月判断一款游戏是否继续，快速验证与及时放弃成为小团队的方法论。</p><div class="meta">10月23日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/podcast-landfalls-rebecca-lautner-on-peaks-23-million-sales-and-looking-past-friendslop" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="opinion"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#D4A574">社评深度观点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/call-of-duty-modern-warfare-4-critical-consensus" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>《Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4》媒体评分解读</h4></a><p class="body">在 2025 年口碑不佳的 Black Ops 7 之后，评论界认为本作让系列回归水准，年货产品的口碑修复周期被压缩到一代之内。</p><div class="meta">10月23日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/call-of-duty-modern-warfare-4-critical-consensus" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="platform"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#8A7FA0">平台政策监管</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/capcom-affected-by-data-breach-over-117m-capcom-id-accounts-compromised" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Capcom 遭数据泄露，逾 1170 万个 Capcom ID 账户受影响</h4></a><p class="body">发行商确认客户信息被未授权第三方访问，调查已完成，账号体系的集中化让单次泄露的影响范围显著扩大。</p><div class="meta">10月23日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/capcom-affected-by-data-breach-over-117m-capcom-id-accounts-compromised" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hotspot"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B0855A">行业热点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/nintendo-veteran-shigeru-miyamoto-to-receive-japans-order-of-culture-award" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>任天堂元老宫本茂将获日本文化勋章</h4></a><p class="body">他是首位获此荣誉的游戏开发者，此前已于 2019 年获“文化功劳者”称号，游戏作为文化形态的官方认可继续提升。</p><div class="meta">10月23日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/nintendo-veteran-shigeru-miyamoto-to-receive-japans-order-of-culture-award" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="tech"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">技术AI工具链</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gamemaker-to-make-its-next-generation-runtime-gmrt-free-for-commercial-use-in-january-2027" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>GameMaker 宣布新一代运行时 GMRT 于 2027 年 1 月起免费商用</h4></a><p class="body">负责人 Russell Kay 表示正在扩大对开发者的供给范围，引擎与运行时的免费化竞争正向下挤压中小工具商的空间。</p><div class="meta">10月23日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gamemaker-to-make-its-next-generation-runtime-gmrt-free-for-commercial-use-in-january-2027" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div></div></div>
<div class="panel" id="week5"><div class="filter-bottom"><div class="fchip active" data-filter="all" onclick="applyFilter('week5','all')">全部</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="hotspot" onclick="applyFilter('week5','hotspot')">行业热点</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="mna" onclick="applyFilter('week5','mna')">融资并购合作</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="finance" onclick="applyFilter('week5','finance')">财报市场数据</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="hr" onclick="applyFilter('week5','hr')">人力资源裁员</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="platform" onclick="applyFilter('week5','platform')">平台政策监管</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="tech" onclick="applyFilter('week5','tech')">技术AI工具链</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="game" onclick="applyFilter('week5','game')">游戏发行运营</div><div class="fchip" data-filter="opinion" onclick="applyFilter('week5','opinion')">社评深度观点</div></div><div class="day-section"><div class="day-header">10月26日</div><div class="article-card" data-cat="game"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B89C5A">游戏发行运营</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/shogun-2-complete-edition-was-not-a-creative-assembly-developed-game-says-total-war-vp-after-it-was-pulled-amid-generative-ai-concerns" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>《Shogun 2》完整版并非 Creative Assembly 自研，因生成式 AI 争议下架</h4></a><p class="body">Total War 副总裁 Roger Collum 承认“把注意力从外部开发上移开了”，外包质量控制在 AI 时代成为品牌风险的第一来源。</p><div class="meta">10月26日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/shogun-2-complete-edition-was-not-a-creative-assembly-developed-game-says-total-war-vp-after-it-was-pulled-amid-generative-ai-concerns" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/microsoft-extends-consultation-period-for-arkane-lyon-as-it-continues-development-on-marvels-blade" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Microsoft 延长 Arkane Lyon 的协商期，《Marvel's Blade》继续开发</h4></a><p class="body">原定截止日为 11 月 13 日，有报道称正在考虑“多种形式的接手方案”，工作室处置从关停转向寻找买方。</p><div class="meta">10月26日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/microsoft-extends-consultation-period-for-arkane-lyon-as-it-continues-development-on-marvels-blade" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="mna"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">融资并购合作</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/netflix-reportedly-offered-500m-to-microsoft-to-license-xbox-ip-for-seven-years" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Netflix 据报出价 5 亿美元向 Microsoft 求购 Xbox IP 七年授权</h4></a><p class="body">有消息称 Asha Sharma 与 Xbox 高管在要求 8 亿美元后拒绝，流媒体平台对游戏 IP 的长期授权需求与平台方估值预期差距明显。</p><div class="meta">10月26日 · 新闻<span class="verify-tag">关键事实待复核</span></div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/netflix-reportedly-offered-500m-to-microsoft-to-license-xbox-ip-for-seven-years" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="opinion"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#D4A574">社评深度观点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/it-was-a-pretty-harrowing-three-months-undead-labs-head-philip-holt-on-what-happened-after-xbox-cut-the-studio-loose" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Undead Labs 负责人谈被 Xbox 剥离后的三个月</h4></a><p class="body">CEO Philip Holt 解释员工持股结构、State of Decay 3 延期原因以及转向联合开发的安排，剥离后的组织重构成本远超预期。</p><div class="meta">10月26日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/it-was-a-pretty-harrowing-three-months-undead-labs-head-philip-holt-on-what-happened-after-xbox-cut-the-studio-loose" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="mna"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">融资并购合作</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/side-expands-presence-in-china-opens-new-studio-and-acquires-art-outsourcing-provider-roboto-entertainment" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Side 扩大中国业务，新设工作室并收购美术外包商 Roboto Entertainment</h4></a><p class="body">Roboto 创始人 Andrea Cordella 出任全球美术负责人与新成都办公室负责人，服务型公司正通过并购把产能直接嵌入中国。</p><div class="meta">10月26日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/side-expands-presence-in-china-opens-new-studio-and-acquires-art-outsourcing-provider-roboto-entertainment" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hotspot"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B0855A">行业热点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/223000-people-sign-petition-to-save-mass-effect" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>逾 22.3 万人联署“拯救 Mass Effect”</h4></a><p class="body">请愿者要求 EA“采取果断行动”保住该 RPG 系列，BioWare 关闭后玩家情绪转化为对发行商 IP 处置的公开施压。</p><div class="meta">10月26日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/223000-people-sign-petition-to-save-mass-effect" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/auroch-digital-lays-off-a-quarter-of-its-staff" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Auroch Digital 裁减四分之一员工</h4></a><p class="body">工作室称“困扰同业的相同市场条件”如今也影响到自己，中型合同制工作室的订单波动正在放大。</p><div class="meta">10月26日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/auroch-digital-lays-off-a-quarter-of-its-staff" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="platform"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#8A7FA0">平台政策监管</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/epic-games-ceo-calls-steams-ai-disclosure-policies-a-political-act" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Epic CEO 称 Steam 的 AI 披露政策是“政治行为”</h4></a><p class="body">他认为强迫开发者写下会被“仇恨群体”利用的声明不可接受，商店的 AI 标注规则成为平台治理与表达争议的交汇点。</p><div class="meta">10月26日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/epic-games-ceo-calls-steams-ai-disclosure-policies-a-political-act" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/xbox-staff-among-up-to-60000-microsoft-employees-offered-voluntary-exit" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Xbox 员工在 Microsoft 最多 6 万人的自愿离职计划范围内</h4></a><p class="body">该计划覆盖美国、英国、加拿大与印度员工，大厂用自愿离职替代强制裁员的规模已接近组织重构级别。</p><div class="meta">10月26日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/xbox-staff-among-up-to-60000-microsoft-employees-offered-voluntary-exit" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div></div><div class="day-section"><div class="day-header">10月27日</div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sucker-punch-productions-reportedly-lays-off-24-employees-following-launch-of-ghost-of-yotei-complete-edition" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Sucker Punch 据报在《Ghost of Yōtei》完整版发售后裁撤 24 人</h4></a><p class="body">内部邮件称决定基于“对市场挑战的观察与下个项目的人员需求”，作品发售后即调整编制正在成为常态。</p><div class="meta">10月27日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sucker-punch-productions-reportedly-lays-off-24-employees-following-launch-of-ghost-of-yotei-complete-edition" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="game"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B89C5A">游戏发行运营</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/timi-studio-groups-pokemon-unite-to-shut-down-on-march-23-2027" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>TiMi 的《Pokémon Unite》将于 2027 年 3 月 23 日停止运营</h4></a><p class="body">这款 MOBA 于 2021 年登陆 Nintendo Switch 与移动端，跨端授权型产品的生命周期在上线五年后走到终点。</p><div class="meta">10月27日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/timi-studio-groups-pokemon-unite-to-shut-down-on-march-23-2027" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="platform"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#8A7FA0">平台政策监管</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/ukie-calls-on-government-to-modernise-video-games-expenditure-credit-ahead-of-autumn-budget" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>UKIE 呼吁在秋季预算前改革游戏支出抵免政策</h4></a><p class="body">协会 CEO 称“改革 VGEC 对英国保持建游戏公司的竞争力至关重要”，税收抵免正成为各国产业政策竞争的主战场。</p><div class="meta">10月27日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/ukie-calls-on-government-to-modernise-video-games-expenditure-credit-ahead-of-autumn-budget" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="opinion"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#D4A574">社评深度观点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/developers-need-to-treat-early-access-like-a-real-launch-because-players-do-early-access-games-are-on-the-rise-but-so-are-player-expectations" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>早期访问专题：开发者必须把 EA 当作正式发售对待</h4></a><p class="body">《Valheim》《Subnautica》《Hades》《Phasmophobia》等团队分享早期访问的得失，玩家的期待管理已等同于首发运营。</p><div class="meta">10月27日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/developers-need-to-treat-early-access-like-a-real-launch-because-players-do-early-access-games-are-on-the-rise-but-so-are-player-expectations" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="platform"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#8A7FA0">平台政策监管</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/warhorse-studios-hit-by-cyberattack-company-systems-and-data-affected" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Warhorse Studios 遭网络攻击，系统与数据受影响</h4></a><p class="body">官方称已投入必要资源应对并将适时披露，中型工作室的网络安全投入与业务连续性风险被再次提醒。</p><div class="meta">10月27日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/warhorse-studios-hit-by-cyberattack-company-systems-and-data-affected" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div></div><div class="day-section"><div class="day-header">10月28日</div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hotspot"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B0855A">行业热点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gamescom-asia-touts-new-records-for-international-attendance-and-showfloor-size" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Gamescom Asia 国际到场与展场面积创纪录</h4></a><p class="body">展会进入第六年，海外观众与国家代表数量同步增长，亚洲展会的国际组织度在提升。</p><div class="meta">10月28日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gamescom-asia-touts-new-records-for-international-attendance-and-showfloor-size" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/jobs-roundup-october-dan-ayoub-promoted-to-president-of-hasbro-digital-games-and-wizards-of-the-coast" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>10 月人事汇总</h4></a><p class="body">Dan Ayoub 升任 Hasbro Digital Games 与 Wizards of the Coast 总裁，Atari 任命《Crossy Road》创作者 Matt Hall 为移动业务 EVP，玩具与复古品牌在补强游戏管理岗。</p><div class="meta">10月28日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/jobs-roundup-october-dan-ayoub-promoted-to-president-of-hasbro-digital-games-and-wizards-of-the-coast" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/interior-night-studio-head-charu-desodt-appointed-chair-of-bafta-games-committee" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Interior Night 负责人 Charu Desodt 出任 BAFTA 游戏委员会主席</h4></a><p class="body">她接替前 Larian 工作室负责人 Tara Saunders，行业组织治理层的更替反映独立工作室话语权上升。</p><div class="meta">10月28日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/interior-night-studio-head-charu-desodt-appointed-chair-of-bafta-games-committee" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="finance"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#7A9E7D">财报市场数据</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/wardogs-leads-newzoos-september-pc-revenue-charts" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>《Wardogs》领跑 Newzoo 9 月 PC 收入榜</h4></a><p class="body">《Marvel's Wolverine》在主机收入榜排第四，Halloween: The Game 与 The Blood of the Dawnwalker 进入跨平台前十，跨平台榜单成为判断产品组合效率的依据。</p><div class="meta">10月28日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/wardogs-leads-newzoos-september-pc-revenue-charts" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="opinion"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#D4A574">社评深度观点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/taking-several-years-with-several-thousand-people-its-almost-impossible-playstation-creator-ken-kutaragi-on-the-current-state-of-gaming" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>PlayStation 之父久夛良木健谈当下游戏业</h4></a><p class="body">他认为“花数年、几千人做一款游戏几乎不可能持续”，平台成本已变得“超级昂贵”，硬件创始人视角对当前 3A 生产模式的批评值得记录。</p><div class="meta">10月28日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/taking-several-years-with-several-thousand-people-its-almost-impossible-playstation-creator-ken-kutaragi-on-the-current-state-of-gaming" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="mna"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">融资并购合作</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/hearth-and-hamlet-publisher-runic-forge-rebrands-as-pythia-games" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>《Hearth and Hamlet》发行商 Runic Forge 更名 Pythia Games</h4></a><p class="body">母公司 Rune 放弃代理业务，专注独立发行，中小发行商在收缩期选择剥离非核心收入线。</p><div class="meta">10月28日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/hearth-and-hamlet-publisher-runic-forge-rebrands-as-pythia-games" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hotspot"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#B0855A">行业热点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/pressengine-announces-the-pre-show-an-in-person-london-showcase-for-upcoming-games" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>PressEngine 宣布伦敦线下展示会 The Pre-Show</h4></a><p class="body">11 月的活动承诺让开发者与 150 余名记者及内容创作者面对面，线下媒体关系在算法分发时代重新获得价值。</p><div class="meta">10月28日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/pressengine-announces-the-pre-show-an-in-person-london-showcase-for-upcoming-games" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div></div><div class="day-section"><div class="day-header">10月29日</div><div class="article-card" data-cat="finance"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#7A9E7D">财报市场数据</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/xbox-first-party-content-partially-offsets-2-drop-in-q1-revenue-hardware-decreases-14" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Xbox 第一方内容部分抵消 Q1 收入 2% 下滑，硬件下降 14%</h4></a><p class="body">Microsoft CEO 强调 Xbox 正进入“多年来最强的一方与三方阵容”，内容供给改善与硬件收缩同时出现在同一份财报里。</p><div class="meta">10月29日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/xbox-first-party-content-partially-offsets-2-drop-in-q1-revenue-hardware-decreases-14" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="finance"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#7A9E7D">财报市场数据</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/onimusha-resident-evil-pragmata-and-monster-hunter-franchises-boost-capcom-h1-results" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>《Onimusha》《Resident Evil》《Pragmata》《Monster Hunter》拉动 Capcom 上半财年业绩</h4></a><p class="body">含游戏的数字内容部门收入大涨 70.8% 至 5.384 亿美元，多 IP 组合让 Capcom 在单作波动中保持增长。</p><div class="meta">10月29日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/onimusha-resident-evil-pragmata-and-monster-hunter-franchises-boost-capcom-h1-results" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="opinion"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#D4A574">社评深度观点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/i-wish-i-had-the-formula-2awesome-studio-on-navigating-indie-development-while-creating-altered-alma-its-biggest-project-to-date" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>2Awesome Studio 谈在“小团队大成功”市场中开发《Altered Alma》</h4></a><p class="body">联合创始人 Alexander Santiago 讨论如何运营工作室并推进迄今最大项目，中型团队的资源分配难题被具体呈现。</p><div class="meta">10月29日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/i-wish-i-had-the-formula-2awesome-studio-on-navigating-indie-development-while-creating-altered-alma-its-biggest-project-to-date" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="opinion"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#D4A574">社评深度观点</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/we-are-very-eager-to-learn-from-the-real-veterans-how-tencents-timi-studio-group-collaborated-with-capcom-on-monster-hunter-outlanders" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>TiMi 与 Capcom 如何合作开发《Monster Hunter Outlanders》</h4></a><p class="body">开发总监解释双方协作方式与转向移动端后的变化，日本 IP 与中国团队的分工模式正从外包转为共同开发。</p><div class="meta">10月29日 · 特稿</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/we-are-very-eager-to-learn-from-the-real-veterans-how-tencents-timi-studio-group-collaborated-with-capcom-on-monster-hunter-outlanders" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="hr"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#A8726D">人力资源裁员</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/newly-merged-skydance-mandates-staff-return-to-office-five-days-a-week-offers-voluntary-buyout-program" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>合并后的 Skydance 要求每周五天到岗并提供自愿买断</h4></a><p class="body">CEO David Ellison 与联席 CEO Ynon Kreiz 称该政策“符合员工最佳利益”，并购整合期的办公政策成为筛选人员的工具。</p><div class="meta">10月29日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/newly-merged-skydance-mandates-staff-return-to-office-five-days-a-week-offers-voluntary-buyout-program" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div></div><div class="day-section"><div class="day-header">10月30日</div><div class="article-card" data-cat="finance"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#7A9E7D">财报市场数据</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/roblox-q3-results-beat-expectations-despite-bookings-falling-12-to-17bn" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Roblox 三季度业绩超预期，预订额下降 12% 至 17 亿美元</h4></a><p class="body">收入同比增长 16% 至 16 亿美元，平台继续扩展 AI 创作工具，用户增长与变现效率的背离仍是其核心矛盾。</p><div class="meta">10月30日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/roblox-q3-results-beat-expectations-despite-bookings-falling-12-to-17bn" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="platform"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#8A7FA0">平台政策监管</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/maddy-makes-games-removes-celeste-and-towerfall-from-xbox-in-support-of-pro-palestinian-bds-boycott" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Maddy Makes Games 为支持 BDS 从 Xbox 下架《Celeste》与《TowerFall》</h4></a><p class="body">更多独立开发者加入下架行动，独立团队以撤出平台表达政治立场，平台的生态吸引力面临价值观层面的分流。</p><div class="meta">10月30日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/maddy-makes-games-removes-celeste-and-towerfall-from-xbox-in-support-of-pro-palestinian-bds-boycott" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div><div class="article-card" data-cat="tech"><div class="cat-tag" style="color:#5A7A91">技术AI工具链</div><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/studio-atelico-launches-atelico-ai-engine-into-early-access" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit" target="_blank"><h4>Studio Atelico 将 Atelico AI Engine 推入早期访问</h4></a><p class="body">CEO 称“成功的不会是使用 AI 最多的工作室，而是把 AI 完全用于玩家体验的工作室”，AI 工具创业进入以质量叙事的阶段。</p><div class="meta">10月30日 · 新闻</div><a class="source-link" href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/studio-atelico-launches-atelico-ai-engine-into-early-access" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">原文 →</a></div></div></div>
